%5B%7B%22title%22%3A%22Dolly%20Parton%2C%20legendary%20country%20music%20superstar%2C%20dead%20at%2080%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F690e81d97f37aa653f55addc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224001%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20performing%20in%20Nashville%20in%202025.%3Cp%3EJason%20Kempin%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EDolly%20Parton%2C%20the%20beloved%20American%20country%20music%20legend%2C%20has%20died%20at%20age%2080.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EParton's%20representatives%20said%20she%20passed%20%26quot%3Bafter%20bravely%20facing%20a%20brief%20battle%20with%20cancer.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EParton%20topped%20the%20Billboard%20country%20music%20charts%2025%20times%20and%20is%20in%20the%20Country%20Music%20Hall%20of%20Fame.%C2%A0%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-life-career-timeline-2020-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDolly%20Parton%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20the%20beloved%2C%20award-winning%20icon%20of%20American%20country%20music%20%E2%80%94%20has%20died.%C2%A0She%20was%2080.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%20nephew%2C%20Bryan%20Seaver%2C%20announced%20the%20news%20on%20Parton's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freels%2FDceNXgPJyZ9%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EInstagram%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20August%2025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20name%20is%20Bryan%20Seaver%2C%20son%20of%20Cassie%20Parton%2C%20and%20I'm%20representing%20the%20Parton%20and%20Owens%20family%20today%2C%20announcing%20the%20passing%20of%20my%20aunt%2C%20Dolly%20Rebecca%20Parton%20Dean.%20Sister%2C%20Sis%2C%20and%20Granny%20to%20one%20generation%20and%20Gigi%20to%20the%20next%2C%26quot%3B%20Seaver%20says%20in%20the%20video.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20video%20announcement%20is%20something%20Dolly%20asked%20of%20me%20years%20ago%2C%20before%20I%20fully%20absorbed%20it%20as%20a%20future%20reality%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20continues.%20%26quot%3BAs%20her%20head%20of%20security%20for%20more%20than%20two%20decades%2C%20a%20role%20my%20father%20Larry%20held%20before%20me%2C%20I%20have%20imagined%20the%20heaviness%20of%20this%20moment%20but%20haven't%20truly%20felt%20it%20'til%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%20representatives%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20Parton%20passed%20%26quot%3Bat%20the%20Vanderbilt-Ingram%20Cancer%20Center%20surrounded%20by%20loved%20ones%26quot%3B%20after%20%26quot%3Bbravely%20facing%20a%20brief%20battle%20with%20cancer.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhether%20it%20be%20the%20hundreds%20of%20millions%20of%20books%20donated%20through%20her%20invaluable%20Imagination%20Library%20or%20funding%20research%20that%20helped%20create%20a%20lifesaving%20vaccine%20used%20around%20the%20world%2C%20Dolly's%20unconditional%20love%20for%20all%20people%20was%20the%20guiding%20force%20for%20her%20lasting%20impact%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton's%20representative%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EConcerns%20over%20Parton's%20health%20arose%20in%20September%202025%2C%20after%20the%20singer%20postponed%20and%20later%20canceled%20her%20Las%20Vegas%20residency.%20The%20news%20prompted%20Parton%20to%20share%20a%20video%20a%20month%20later%20to%20reassure%20her%20fans.%20%26quot%3BI%20want%20you%20to%20know%20I'm%20OK.%20I've%20got%20some%20problems%20...%20nothing%20major%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said%2C%20adding%2C%20%26quot%3BI%20ain't%20dead%20yet.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20August%2021%2C%20Parton%20shared%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpeople.com%2Fdolly-parton-dead-7565853%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehealth%20update%20with%20People%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20telling%20the%20magazine%20she%20was%20dealing%20with%20some%20%26quot%3Bhealth%20issues.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEven%20though%20I'm%20still%20healin'%2C%20I'm%20still%20workin'!%20You%20know%20me%20%E2%80%94%20as%20I've%20often%20said%20%E2%80%94%20I've%20dreamed%20myself%20into%20a%20corner%2C%20and%20I%20still%20have%20so%20many%20things%20I%20want%20to%20achieve%2C%20so%20I'm%20gonna%20keep%20on%20working%20as%20long%20as%20I%20can%20to%20see%20everything%20come%20to%20life.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Ciframe%20width%3D%5C%22100%25%5C%22%20title%3D%5C%22In%20memory%20of%20Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jwplayer.com%2Fplayers%2FOzOL4N2x-XildMFVD.html%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22100%25%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fiframe%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20legendary%20singer-songwriter%2C%20famed%20for%20her%20towering%20hair%20and%20razor-sharp%20wit%2C%20topped%20the%20Billboard%20country%20music%20charts%20with%2025%20of%20her%20songs%20and%20won%2011%20Grammys%2C%20including%20a%20Grammy%20Lifetime%20Achievement%20Award%2C%2010%20Country%20Music%20Association%20Awards%2C%20and%20four%20People's%20Choice%20Awards.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20also%20holds%20a%20place%20in%20the%20Country%20Music%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20in%20Nashville%20and%20the%20Rock%20and%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThroughout%20her%20life%2C%20Parton%20became%20a%20successful%20businesswoman%2C%20actor%2C%20philanthropist%2C%20and%20even%20theme-park%20owner%20as%20she%20rose%20to%20superstardom%20not%20just%20as%20a%20country%20artist%20but%20also%20as%20a%20humanitarian%20and%20LGBTQ%2B%20advocate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224e7f3b62-109b-41d0-83f8-79a4a7b80f76%5C%22%3EParton%20began%20giving%20live%20performances%20at%20age%206%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222578%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20circa%201955%20in%20Tennessee%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68dbed4bcc993f9955cf2f95%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223150%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20circa%201955%20in%20Tennessee.%3Cp%3EMichael%20Ochs%20Archives%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20was%20born%20in%201946%20in%20a%20one-room%20cabin%20in%20Pittman%20Center%2C%20Tennessee.%20She%20was%20the%20fourth%20of%2012%20kids%20and%20grew%20up%20to%20the%20sound%20of%20Smoky%20Mountain%20folklore%20sung%20by%20her%20mother%2C%20Avie%20Lee%20Parton.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20often%20credited%20her%20mother%20and%20aunt%20for%20her%20musical%20abilities%20and%20her%20father%2C%20Robert%20Lee%20Parton%2C%20for%20her%20business%20savvy%2C%20which%20she%20wrote%20about%20in%20her%20book%20%26quot%3BSongteller%3A%20My%20Life%20in%20Lyrics.%26quot%3B%20Parton%20described%20her%20family%20as%20%26quot%3Bdirt%20poor%26quot%3B%20in%20a%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fedition.cnn.com%2F2002%2FSHOWBIZ%2FMusic%2F07%2F09%2Fdolly.parton.cnna%2Findex.html%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2002%20CNN%20interview%3C%2Fa%3E.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAlthough%20we%20had%20no%20money%2C%20I%20was%20rich%20as%20I%20could%20be%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20would%20sing%20in%20her%20hit%20song%20%26quot%3BCoat%20of%20Many%20Colors%2C%26quot%3B%20inspired%20by%20a%20coat%20her%20mother%20once%20made%20from%20scraps%20of%20fabric.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20began%20singing%20in%20her%20church%20at%20age%206.%20She%20taught%20herself%20how%20to%20play%20guitar%20on%20a%20homemade%20version%20of%20the%20instrument%20at%207%20and%20got%20her%20first%20real%20guitar%20by%208.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPublic%20performances%20continued%20throughout%20Parton's%20childhood%2C%20culminating%20in%20a%20live%20show%20at%20the%20Grand%20Ole%20Opry%20at%20the%20age%20of%2013%2C%20where%20she%20met%20Johnny%20Cash%20for%20the%20first%20time.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20moved%20to%20Nashville%20the%20day%20after%20she%20graduated%20from%20high%20school%20in%201964.%20On%20her%20very%20first%20day%2C%20she%20met%20a%20young%20man%20named%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-husband-carl-dean-relationship-timeline%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECarl%20Dean%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20a%20laundromat.%20Parton%20told%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F1976%2F05%2F09%2Farchives%2Fthe-country-girl-country-girl.html%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EThe%20New%20York%20Times%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%201976%20that%20Dean%20asked%20her%20out%20on%20a%20date%20and%20she%20declined%2C%20but%20she%20invited%20him%20to%20come%20by%20while%20she%20babysat%20her%20nephew.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHe%20came%20up%20every%20day%20that%20week%2C%20and%20we%20sat%20out%20on%20the%20porch.%20I%20wouldn't%20even%20take%20him%20in%20the%20house%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20recalled.%20%26quot%3BThen%20my%20aunt%20got%20a%20day%20off%2C%20and%20she%20could%20keep%20the%20kid%2C%20and%20that%20was%20my%20first%20chance%20to%20go%20anywhere%20with%20Carl%2C%20and%20he%20drove%20me%20straight%20to%20his%20folks'%20house%20and%20introduced%20me%20to%20his%20mother%20and%20daddy.%20'Cause%20he%20said%20he%20knew%20right%20the%20minute%20he%20saw%20me%20that%20that's%20the%20one%20he%20wanted.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETwo%20years%20later%2C%20they%20were%20married.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22feaab64b-e2b0-49fb-a52a-629cc03ccf14%5C%22%3EParton's%20stint%20on%20'The%20Porter%20Wagoner%20Show'%20shot%20her%20to%20stardom%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Parton%20and%20Porter%20Wagoner%20perform%20onstage%20circa%201967.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68dbed93cc993f9955cf2fb2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222358%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EParton%20and%20Porter%20Wagoner%20perform%20onstage%20circa%201967.%3Cp%3EMichael%20Ochs%20Archives%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20quickly%20signed%20with%20Combine%20Publishing%20and%20teamed%20up%20with%20her%20uncle%20%E2%80%94%20country%20singer%20and%20songwriter%20Bill%20Owens%20%E2%80%94%20to%20produce%20multiple%20chart-topping%20singles.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHer%20career%20really%20took%20off%20in%20the%20late%201960s%2C%20when%20Parton%20joined%20%26quot%3BThe%20Porter%20Wagoner%20Show.%26quot%3B%20The%20collaboration%20led%20to%20a%20string%20of%20chart-topping%20singles%20with%20Wagoner%2C%20who%20convinced%20RCA%20Victor%20to%20sign%20Parton%20in%201967.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20finally%20hit%20the%20top%20of%20the%20charts%20as%20a%20solo%20artist%20with%20her%20single%20%26quot%3BJoshua%26quot%3B%20in%201971.%20Her%20success%20continued%20with%20songs%20like%20%26quot%3BCoat%20of%20Many%20Colors%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3BTouch%20Your%20Woman.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%201973%2C%20Parton%20earned%20one%20of%20the%20biggest%20hits%20of%20her%20career%20with%20the%20song%20%26quot%3BJolene%2C%26quot%3B%20inspired%20by%20a%20bank%20teller%20who%20had%20a%20crush%20on%20her%20husband.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221417%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20%26quot%3BJolene%26quot%3B%20album%20cover%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F626de4cb0983640018c097cd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221417%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20album%20cover%20for%20%26quot%3BJolene%26quot%3B%20by%20Dolly%20Parton%2C%20which%20was%20released%20in%201974.%3Cp%3EDonaldson%20Collection%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20penned%20the%20song%20the%20same%20night%20she%20wrote%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-writing-two-biggest-songs-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3BI%20Will%20Always%20Love%20You%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20which%20became%20a%20mega-hit%20when%20the%20late%20Whitney%20Houston%20covered%20it%20for%20the%20soundtrack%20to%20the%201992%20film%20%26quot%3BThe%20Bodyguard.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhen%20I%20wrote%20those%20songs%2C%20I%20remember%20just%20sitting%20in%20the%20corner%20of%20this%20couch%20by%20this%20fireplace%20that%20was%20in%20the%20first%20house%20that%20Carl%20and%20I%20ever%20owned%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20told%20Business%20Insider%20in%202022.%20%26quot%3BThere%20was%20just%20something%20about%20that%20fireplace%2C%20the%20coziness%2C%20and%20that%20corner.%20The%20one%20corner%20of%20the%20couch%20where%20I%20was%20always%20sitting%20with%20my%20feet%20up%2C%20writing%20and%20singing%20my%20songs.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22783afc49-3143-4038-bb51-8ecb0a28a56c%5C%22%3EParton%20tried%20her%20hand%20at%20the%20world%20of%20pop%20music%C2%A0%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222187%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20in%20a%20bright%20pink%20and%20white%20blouse%2C%20vest%2C%20and%20pant%20ensemble.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61e868e07c6a200018429d2c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221640%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20attends%20the%2019th%20Annual%20Grammy%20Awards%20on%20February%2019%2C%201977.%3Cp%3ERon%20Galella%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%201976%2C%20Parton%20began%20working%20with%20Sandy%20Gallin%2C%20who%20would%20be%20her%20manager%20for%2025%20years.%20With%20Gallin%2C%20Parton%20co-produced%20%26quot%3BNew%20Harvest...First%20Gathering%26quot%3B%20in%201977.%20It%20was%20the%20first%20time%20she%20had%20experimented%20with%20pop%20hits%2C%20and%20the%20album%20topped%20Billboard's%20country%20albums%20chart%20and%20reached%20No.%2071%20on%20the%20Billboard%20200.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHer%20next%20album%2C%20%26quot%3BHere%20You%20Come%20Again%2C%26quot%3B%20released%20in%201977%2C%20became%20the%20first%20of%20Parton's%20solo%20albums%20to%20sell%20more%20than%20one%20million%20copies%20and%20led%20her%20to%20her%20first%20single%20on%20the%20pop%20charts.%20Parton%20continued%20on%20the%20path%20of%20pop-crossover%20success%2C%20winning%20a%20Grammy%20Award%20for%20best%20female%20country%20vocal%20performance%20in%201978.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThroughout%20the%20late%201970s%20and%201980s%2C%20Parton%20released%20hit%20singles%20%26quot%3BBaby%20I'm%20Burning%2C%26quot%3B%20%26quot%3BIslands%20in%20the%20Stream%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-cooking-for-miley-cyrus-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3B9%20to%205%2C%26quot%3B%3C%2Fa%3E%20which%20coincided%20with%20Parton's%20star%20turn%20as%20a%20working%20woman%20trying%20to%20take%20down%20her%20sexist%20boss%20in%20the%201980%20hit%20comedy%20alongside%20Jane%20Fonda%20and%20Lily%20Tomlin.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3B9%20to%205%26quot%3B%20became%20Parton's%20first%20song%20to%20become%20a%20triple%20No.%201%20hit%2C%20taking%20the%20leading%20spot%20in%20the%20country%2C%20pop%2C%20and%20adult%20contemporary%20charts.%C2%A0During%20this%20time%2C%20she%20had%2012%20top-ten%20hits%2C%20six%20of%20which%20went%20No.%201.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lily%20Tomlin%2C%20Jane%20Fonda%20and%20Dolly%20Parton%20on%209%20to%205%20set%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F625d954c3958c2001823e546%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223031%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELily%20Tomlin%2C%20Jane%20Fonda%2C%20and%20Dolly%20Parton%20on%20the%20set%20of%20%26quot%3B9%20to%205.%26quot%3B%3Cp%3ETwentieth%20Century%20Fox%20Film%20Corporation%2FSunset%20Boulevard%2FCorbis%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%201977%2C%20Parton%20met%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-on-meeting-queen-elizabeth-2023-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EQueen%20Elizabeth%20II%3C%2Fa%3E%20after%20performing%20at%20the%20Silver%20Jubilee.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20was%20scared%20to%20death%20that%20I%20was%20not%20going%20to%20know%20how%20to%20curtsy%2C%20that%20I%20wasn't%20going%20to%20bend%20right%2C%20but%20she%20was%20just%20very%20warm%2C%20very%20sweet%2C%20and%20I%20could%20tell%20she%20was%20a%20very%20giving%20person%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20recalled%20during%20a%202022%20interview%20with%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BAnd%20just%20meeting%20the%20Queen%20of%20England%2C%20just%20to%20meet%20a%20queen%2C%20it%20was%20amazing.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2260d470a7-a419-4832-bab2-7f7a54e930be%5C%22%3EParton%20returned%20to%20her%20roots%20as%20a%20country%20music%20icon%C2%A0%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThroughout%20the%201990s%20and%202000s%2C%20Parton%20released%20a%20wide%20array%20of%20music%2C%20ranging%20from%20country%20to%20pop%20to%20bluegrass%2C%20solidifying%20her%20status%20as%20one%20of%20the%20greatest%20country%20music%20artists%20of%20all%20time.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20became%20a%20songwriting%20staple%20in%20Hollywood%2C%20with%20many%20of%20her%202000s%20releases%20accompanying%20movies%2C%20TV%20shows%2C%20or%20Broadway%20shows.%20She%20also%20teamed%20up%20with%20stars%20such%20as%20Brad%20Paisley%20and%20Beyonc%C3%A9%20to%20release%20new%20music.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222683%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20with%20her%20arms%20open%20wide%20wearing%20a%20shiny%2C%20colorful%20patchwork%20blazer%20and%20cream-colored%20pants.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F61e869029386c900185f6212%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222012%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20accepts%20the%20Tex%20Ritter%20Award%20onstage%20during%20the%2051st%20Academy%20of%20Country%20Music%20Awards%20on%20April%203%2C%202016%2C%20in%20Las%20Vegas.%3Cp%3EEthan%20Miller%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202014%2C%20Parton%20released%20%26quot%3BBlue%20Smoke%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20became%20her%20first%20top-10%20album%20and%20her%20highest-ranking%20solo%20album%20ever.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%20first%20holiday%20album%2C%20%26quot%3BA%20Holly%20Dolly%20Christmas%2C%26quot%3B%20was%20released%20in%20October%202020%20and%20was%20accompanied%20by%20a%20CBS%20Christmas%20special%20of%20the%20same%20name.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d5cb6467-0ee3-4cf3-a239-83dfdf360e32%5C%22%3EParton%20was%20more%20than%20a%20singer-songwriter%C2%A0%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202009%2C%20Parton%20released%20%26quot%3B9%20to%205%3A%20The%20Musical%26quot%3B%20on%20Broadway%2C%20a%20live%20adaptation%20of%20the%201980%20film%2C%20scored%20by%20her%20famed%20album.%20Though%20the%20show%20was%20not%20a%20hit%2C%20it%20earned%20her%20a%20Tony%20nomination%20for%20best%20original%20score.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20also%20poured%20much%20of%20her%20earnings%20into%20her%20own%20business%20ventures%2C%20put%20on%20by%20The%20Dollywood%20Company.%20Most%20notably%2C%20she%20opened%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-fan-visited-dolly-parton-theme-park-dollywood-surprising-things-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDollywood%20theme%20park%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20Pigeon%20Forge%2C%20Tennessee.%20She%20focused%20much%20of%20her%20business%20near%20her%20hometown%2C%20opening%20a%20dinner%20theater%2C%20a%20water%20park%2C%20and%20a%20spa%20all%20in%20Pigeon%20Forge.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20avid%20cook%20who%20loved%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-cooking-for-miley-cyrus-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewhipping%20up%20Southern%20cuisine%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Parton%20also%20released%20two%20cookbooks%2C%20including%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-mac-and-cheese-thanksgiving-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3BGood%20Lookin'%20Cookin'%2C%26quot%3B%3C%2Fa%3E%20which%20she%20wrote%20with%20her%20sister%20Rachel%20Parton%20George.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223853%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20entrance%20to%20Dollywood%20in%20Pigeon%20Forge%2C%20Tennessee.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68dbee8c1c1f80efbec494e6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222569%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20entrance%20to%20Dollywood%20in%20Pigeon%20Forge%2C%20Tennessee.%3Cp%3EGeorge%20Rose%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20started%20Sandollar%20Productions%20with%20Gallin%2C%20which%20went%20on%20to%20produce%20a%20number%20of%20films%20and%20TV%20shows%2C%20including%20%26quot%3BFather%20of%20the%20Bride%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3BBuffy%20the%20Vampire%20Slayer.%26quot%3B%C2%A0She%20also%20appeared%20on%20the%20other%20side%20of%20the%20camera%2C%20acting%20on%20shows%20such%20as%20%26quot%3BReba%2C%26quot%3B%20%26quot%3BThe%20Simpsons%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3BHannah%20Montana.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20tireless%20multi-hyphenate%2C%20Parton%20told%20Business%20Insider%20in%202022%20that%20she%20often%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-wakes-up-at-3-in-the-morning-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estarted%20her%20day%20at%203%20a.m.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20do%20some%20of%20my%20best%20work%20there%2C%20but%20I%20get%20enough%20sleep%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20added.%20%26quot%3BI%20don't%20require%20as%20much%20sleep%20as%20a%20lot%20of%20other%20people%20do%3B%20that's%20kind%20of%20a%20Parton%20family%20trait.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BDolly%20Parton's%20Heartstrings%2C%26quot%3B%20an%20eight-part%20docuseries%20about%20Parton's%20life%2C%20aired%20on%20Netflix%20in%202019%20and%20became%20the%20subject%20of%20the%20NPR%20podcast%20%26quot%3BDolly%20Parton's%20America.%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22510144ee-bcb6-4238-8c65-2311f9038d62%5C%22%3EA%20mother%20figure%20and%20philanthropist%20to%20many%C2%A0%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20and%20Carl%20Dean%20never%20had%20children%20due%20to%20Parton's%20struggle%20with%20endometriosis.%20Instead%2C%20the%20couple%20helped%20to%20raise%20her%20younger%20siblings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-husband-carl-dean-food-love-language-favorite-recipes-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECarl%20Dean%3C%2Fa%3E%20died%20in%20March%202025%20at%20the%20age%20of%2082.%20He%20and%20Parton%20had%20been%20married%20for%20nearly%2059%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20was%20also%20the%20godmother%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-miley-cyrus-hair-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Epop%20star%20Miley%20Cyrus%3C%2Fa%3E.%20She%20told%20Business%20Insider%20in%202023%20that%20she%20hoped%20Cyrus%20would%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-miley-cyrus-biopic-2023-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eplay%20her%20in%20a%20biopic%3C%2Fa%3E%20someday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222404%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dolly%20parton%20miley%20cyrus%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F5fc54db350e71a0011558067%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221797%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20performing%20with%20her%20goddaughter%2C%20Miley%20Cyrus.%3Cp%3EKevin%20Mazur%2FGetty%20Images%20for%20The%20Recording%20Academy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20love%20the%20fact%20that%20she's%20brave%20enough%20to%20do%20whatever%20she%20feels%20like%20doing%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20said%20of%20her%20goddaughter%20at%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThrough%20the%20Dollywood%20Foundation%2C%20Parton%20was%20an%20active%20philanthropist%20for%20most%20of%20her%20career.%20She%20mainly%20focused%20on%20literacy%2C%20launching%20Dolly%20Parton's%20Imagination%20Library%2C%20which%20mails%20one%20book%20a%20month%20to%20every%20enrolled%20child.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20was%20also%20known%20to%20be%20an%20outspoken%20advocate%20for%20the%20American%20Red%20Cross%20and%20several%20HIV%2FAIDS%20charities.%20For%20her%20philanthropic%20efforts%2C%20she%20won%20awards%2C%20including%20the%20Association%20of%20American%20Publishers%20Honors%20Award%20for%20her%20work%20in%20literacy.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20the%20COVID-19%20pandemic%2C%20Parton%20donated%20%241%20million%20toward%20research%20at%20Vanderbilt%20University%20Medical%20Center%2C%20which%20funded%20the%20early%20stages%20of%20the%20Moderna%20vaccine's%20development.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20also%20became%20a%20queer%20icon%2C%20frequently%20advocating%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmiley-cyrus-dolly-parton-ban-teacher-fired-2023-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ELGBTQ%2B%20rights%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20equality.%20In%20an%20interview%20with%20Larry%20King%20in%202016%2C%20Parton%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BI%20do%20not%20believe%20that%20we%20should%20criticize%20and%20judge%20other%20people.%20I%20think%20we%20should%20be%20accepting%20and%20loving.%20We%20are%20all%20God's%20children%2C%20we%20are%20who%20we%20are%2C%20and%20we%20should%20be%20allowed%20to%20be%20who%20we%20are.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20her%20last%20interview%20with%20Business%20Insider%20in%202023%2C%20Parton%20said%20she%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-doesnt-want-to-be-younger-2023-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewasn't%20afraid%20of%20getting%20older%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20way%20I%20live%2C%20the%20way%20I%20work%2C%20the%20way%20I%20feel%2C%20I'm%20going%20to%20make%20every%20moment%20count%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20may%20live%20to%20be%20100%2C%20or%20I%20may%20die%20tomorrow%2C%20but%20whenever%20that%20is%2C%20I%20will%20know%20I%20died%20trying%2C%20and%20I%20will%20know%20I've%20done%20everything%20I%20could%20to%20make%20the%20most%20of%20everything.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-country-legend-dead-2026-08%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787704921000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8dddbe45e6f385a5168b1b%3Fformat%3D