%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20in%20%26quot%3B9%20To%205.%26quot%3B%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df08c79f11f0a89f909ca%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222088%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20in%20%26quot%3B9%20To%205.%26quot%3B%3Cp%3EMichael%20Ochs%20Archives%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20wrote%20and%20recorded%20%26quot%3B9%20to%205%26quot%3B%20for%20the%20comedy%20film%20of%20the%20same%20name%2C%20in%20which%20she%20starred%20opposite%20Lily%20Tomlin%20and%20Jane%20Fonda.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20crossover%20hit%20became%20her%20first%20No.%201%20on%20the%20Billboard%20Hot%20100%2C%20peaking%20in%201981.%20It%20also%20won%20two%20Grammys%20and%20was%20nominated%20for%20an%20Oscar.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%26quot%3BIslands%20in%20the%20Stream%26quot%3B%20(1983)%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222682%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kenny%20Rogers%20and%20Dolly%20Parton%20perform%20together%20circa%201986.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8e00b279f11f0a89f90a94%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221968%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EKenny%20Rogers%20and%20Dolly%20Parton%20perform%20together%20circa%201986.%3Cp%3EMike%20Slaughter%2FToronto%20Star%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIslands%20in%20the%20Stream%26quot%3B%20was%20originally%20written%20by%20the%20Bee%20Gees%20and%20recorded%20as%20a%20duet%20between%20Parton%20and%20Kenny%20Rogers.%20It%20was%20released%20as%20a%20single%20from%20Rogers'%20album%20%26quot%3BEyes%20That%20See%20in%20the%20Dark.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20song%20became%20Parton's%20second%20No.%201%20on%20the%20Hot%20100%2C%20remaining%20atop%20the%20chart%20for%20two%20weeks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%26quot%3BWildflowers%26quot%3B%20(1987)%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222741%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Linda%20Ronstadt%2C%20Dolly%20Parton%2C%20and%20Emmylou%20Harris%20photographed%20in%201987.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8e06d53f7df8787cff3598%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222056%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELinda%20Ronstadt%2C%20Dolly%20Parton%2C%20and%20Emmylou%20Harris%20photographed%20in%201987.%3Cp%3EPaul%20Harris%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWildflowers%2C%26quot%3B%20a%20solo%20Parton%20composition%2C%20was%20included%20on%20%26quot%3BTrio%2C%26quot%3B%20her%20landmark%20collaborative%20album%20with%20Linda%20Ronstadt%20and%20Emmylou%20Harris.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BTrio%26quot%3B%20was%20the%20only%20album%20in%20Parton's%20discography%20to%20be%20nominated%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgrammys-artists-never-won-album-of-the-year-2023-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ealbum%20of%20the%20year%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20the%20Grammys.%20Although%20it%20lost%20to%20U2's%20%26quot%3BThe%20Joshua%20Tree%2C%26quot%3B%20it%20won%20the%20Academy%20of%20Country%20Music%20Award%20for%20album%20of%20the%20year%20in%201988.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20know%2C%20for%20me%2C%20this%20will%20always%20stand%20as%20one%20of%20the%20great%20musical%20things%20that%20I've%20ever%20done%20in%20my%20entire%20life%2C%26quot%3B%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftheboot.com%2Ftrio-dolly-parton-emmylou-harris-linda-ronstadt-interview-2016%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EParton%20later%20said%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20the%20supergroup.%20%26quot%3BI've%20never%20been%20prouder%20of%20anything.%20I%20love%20these%20girls%20like%20sisters%2C%20but%20what%20we%20did%20as%20a%20trio%2C%20really%2C%20I%20think%20is%20going%20to%20stand%20up%20long%20after%20we're%20gone.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%26quot%3BShine%26quot%3B%20(2001)%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20was%20inducted%20into%20the%20Songwriters%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20in%202001.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8e056545e6f385a5168d6c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222160%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20was%20inducted%20into%20the%20Songwriters%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20in%202001.%3Cp%3EScott%20Gries%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%202001%20album%20%26quot%3BLittle%20Sparrow%26quot%3B%20was%20dedicated%20to%20her%20father%2C%20who%20died%20months%20before%20its%20release.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20album's%20second%20track%20was%20a%20Dolly-fied%20cover%20of%20Collective%20Soul's%20alt-rock%20'90s%20hit%20%26quot%3BShine%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20earned%20Parton%20a%20Grammy%20for%20female%20country%20vocal%20performance.%20%26quot%3BLittle%20Sparrow%26quot%3B%20was%20also%20nominated%20for%20best%20bluegrass%20album.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%26quot%3BRockin'%20It%26quot%3B%20(2023)%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20performs%20during%20the%2037th%20annual%20Rock%20%26amp%3B%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20Induction%20Ceremony.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df1e33f7df8787cff347d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20performs%20during%20the%2037th%20annual%20Rock%20%26amp%3B%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20Induction%20Ceremony.%3Cp%3EKevin%20Mazur%2FGetty%20Images%20for%20The%20Rock%20and%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%20final%20album%2C%20%26quot%3BRockstar%2C%26quot%3B%20was%20a%20mix%20of%20original%20material%20and%20classic%20rock%20covers.%20She%20said%20she%20was%20inspired%20by%20her%20Rock%20%26amp%3B%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20nomination%20to%20craft%20a%20tribute%20to%20the%20genre.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEven%20though%20I%20am%20extremely%20flattered%20and%20grateful%20to%20be%20nominated%20for%20the%20Rock%20%26amp%3B%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%2C%20I%20don't%20feel%20that%20I%20have%20earned%20that%20right%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20said%20when%20she%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-declines-rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame-nomination-2022-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etried%20to%20decline%20the%20nomination%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20do%20hope%20that%20the%20Rock%20%26amp%3B%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame%20will%20understand%20and%20be%20willing%20to%20consider%20me%20again%20%E2%80%94%20if%20I'm%20ever%20worthy%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20continued.%20%26quot%3BThis%20has%2C%20however%2C%20inspired%20me%20to%20put%20out%20a%20hopefully%20great%20rock%20'n'%20roll%20album%20at%20some%20point%20in%20the%20future%2C%20which%20I%20have%20always%20wanted%20to%20do!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20her%20statement%2C%20Parton%20was%20inducted%20later%20that%20year%20and%20debuted%20a%20new%20song%2C%20%26quot%3BRockin'%20It%2C%26quot%3B%20at%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fultimateclassicrock.com%2Fdolly-parton-rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame-performance%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Einduction%20ceremony%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20live%20recording%20was%20later%20included%20on%20the%20deluxe%20version%20of%20%26quot%3BRockstar.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI've%20been%20rockin'%2C%20rockin'%2C%20rockin'%20since%20the%20day%20I%20was%20born%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20sings%20in%20the%20chorus.%20%26quot%3BI'll%20be%20rockin'%20'til%20the%20day%20I'm%20gone.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-songs-to-know-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787695355000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df2f379f11f0a89f909f7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-songs-to-know-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Dolly%20Parton%20wrote%20hits