t%20of%20unworkable%20tariffs%20would%20be%20felt%20well%20beyond%20Canadian%20assembly%20plants%2C%26quot%3B%20Erin%20Keating%2C%20an%20executive%20analyst%20at%20Cox%20Automotive%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BSome%20of%20America's%20most%20popular%20vehicles%20are%20built%20in%20Canada.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ab12791e-b3ad-4c91-a7cf-69534827af80%5C%22%3EAutomakers%20have%20escape%20routes%20%E2%80%94%20but%20they%20aren't%20simple%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227558%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Rows%20of%20newly-assembled%20Honda%20vehicles%20are%20parked%20outside%20the%20Alliston%2C%20Ontario%2C%20plant.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8dfd7d3f7df8787cff3523%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225039%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERows%20of%20newly-assembled%20Honda%20vehicles%20are%20parked%20outside%20the%20Alliston%2C%20Ontario%2C%20plant.%3Cp%3ECole%20BURSTON%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ETariff%20exposure%20would%20not%20be%20evenly%20distributed%20across%20every%20vehicle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToyota%2C%20Honda%2C%20Ford%2C%20and%20General%20Motors%20also%20rely%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgm-invest-gas-cars-ev-demand-misses-expectations-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eassembly%20plants%20in%20the%20US%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20build%20these%20high-volume%20cars.%20That%20could%20allow%20the%20automakers%20to%20shift%20some%20production%2C%20David%20Whiston%2C%20an%20auto%20analyst%20at%20Morningstar%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHonda%2C%20for%20example%2C%20already%20moved%20a%20portion%20of%20the%20Canadian%20CR-V%20production%20intended%20for%20US%20buyers%20to%20Ohio%20in%202025%2C%20although%20its%20Ontario%20plant%20continues%20to%20export%20vehicles%20to%20the%20US.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20timing%20is%20difficult%20for%20several%20of%20these%20high-volume%20nameplates.%20Because%20of%20production%20constraints%2C%20RAV4%20sales%20are%20down%2036%25%20this%20year%2C%20following%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftoyota-rav4-suv-new-upgrades-hybrid-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EToyota's%20redesign%20of%3C%2Fa%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftoyota-rav4-suv-new-upgrades-hybrid-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20the%20popular%20SUV%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20automaker%20is%20already%20trying%20to%20ramp%20production%20at%20its%20current%20factories%20to%20meet%20demand.%20GM%20is%20preparing%20its%20Oshawa%20plant%20to%20build%20its%20next%20generation%20of%20full-size%20Silverados.%20Ford%2C%20meanwhile%2C%20has%20spent%20roughly%20CA%24%205%20billion%20retooling%20Oakville%20to%20produce%20Super%20Duty%20trucks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20math%20on%20that%20just%20got%20a%20lot%20worse%20for%20them%20with%20the%2050%25%20tariff%2C%26quot%3B%20Whiston%20said%20about%20the%20Canadian%20investments.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222b79a7ab-c925-40e0-9b31-9111aa028ac4%5C%22%3EWhite%20House's%20solution%3A%20Build%20in%20America%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20GM%20employee%20drives%20a%20cart%20in%20an%20assembly%20plant.%20There's%20a%20large%20American%20flag%20behind%20a%20full-size%20car%20in%20the%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df95545e6f385a5168cca%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222781%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ECar%20companies%20have%20invested%20billions%20in%20US%20plants.%20So%20far%2C%20those%20investments%20haven't%20focused%20on%20reshoring%20production%20in%20Canada.%3Cp%3EJEFF%20KOWALSKY%2FAFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20White%20House%20defended%20the%20tariffs%20as%20an%20incentive%20for%20automakers%20to%20expand%20US%20production.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BPresident%20Trump%20has%20always%20been%20clear%3A%20if%20you%20don't%20want%20to%20worry%20about%20tariffs%2C%20make%20your%20product%20in%20the%20USA%2C%26quot%3B%20White%20House%20spokesman%20Kush%20Desai%20said.%20%26quot%3BDomestic%20and%20foreign%20automakers%20alike%2C%20from%20Ford%20to%20Stellantis%20to%20Toyota%2C%20are%20investing%20billions%20to%20reshore%20manufacturing%20back%20to%20America%20without%20raising%20prices%20for%20this%20reason%2C%20and%20other%20automakers%20should%20follow%20suit.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20investments%20do%20not%20necessarily%20replace%20the%20Canadian%20capacity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-toyotas-texas-investment-tariffs-usmca2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%243.6%20billion%20Toyota%20investment%3C%2Fa%3E%20recently%20highlighted%20by%20the%20White%20House%20will%20move%20Tacoma%20production%20from%20Mexico%20to%20Texas%20by%202030.%20It%20has%20no%20impact%20on%20the%20higher-volume%20RAV4.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20also%20remains%20unclear%20how%20the%20new%20tariff%20would%20be%20calculated.%20The%20current%2025%25%20tariff%20on%20Canadian%20vehicles%20provides%20a%20discount%20for%20US%20content.%20The%20White%20House%20did%20not%20directly%20answer%20whether%20the%20tariffs%20themselves%20could%20affect%20vehicle%20prices%20and%20availability.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226e37354f-b427-44b5-94e9-1d3f6f6af34c%5C%22%3EStill%20time%20for%20a%20deal%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223631%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Left%20to%20right%3A%20President%20Donald%20Trump%2C%20Mexican%20President%20Claudia%20Sheinbaum%2C%20and%20Canadian%20Prime%20Minister%20Mark%20Carney.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df8c43f7df8787cff34de%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222421%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETrump's%20tariff%20threat%20comes%20as%20the%20US%2C%20Mexico%2C%20and%20Canada%20are%20about%20to%20renegotiate%20the%20USMCA.%3Cp%3EAlex%20Livesey%20-%20Danehouse%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAutomakers%20have%20four%20months%20to%20adjust%20their%20sourcing%20and%20production%20plans%2C%20and%20the%20tariff%20could%20still%20change%20through%20negotiations%20between%20Washington%20and%20Ottawa%2C%20analysts%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20think%20a%20lot%20is%20still%20to%20happen%20between%20now%20and%20January%201%2C%20so%20maybe%20the%20two%20countries%20will%20work%20something%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20Whiston%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKeating%20said%20the%20parts%20tariffs%20could%20also%20reach%20drivers%20who%20aren't%20shopping%20for%20a%20new%20vehicle.%20More%20expensive%20replacement%20parts%20could%20raise%20repair%20and%20insurance%20costs%2C%20she%20said%2C%20regardless%20of%20where%20a%20driver's%20vehicle%20was%20assembled.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20bigger%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faffordable-vehicles-disappearing-american-car-market-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Equestion%20is%20affordability%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20Keating%20said.%20%26quot%3BAny%20policy%20that%20increases%20costs%20puts%20additional%20pressure%20on%20a%20market%20where%20many%20households%20already%20feel%20that%20virtually%20everything%20costs%20more%20than%20it%20did%20a%20few%20years%20ago.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToyota%20declined%20to%20comment.%20Honda%20did%20not%20provide%20a%20comment%20by%20publication%20time.%20Ford%20and%20GM%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20requests%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-canada-tariffs-americas-favorite-cars-toyota-chevy-honda-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787695041000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8dc80945e6f385a5168a52%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-canada-tariffs-americas-favorite-cars-toyota-chevy-honda-2026-8