ttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbose-quietcomfort-headphones-2nd-gen-review%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787691406000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c99064569a4ec219f9a2b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbose-quietcomfort-headphones-2nd-gen-review%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Bose's%20QuietComfort%202nd%20Gen%20have%20improved%20noise%20cancellation%20and%20USB-C%20playback%2C%20offering%20performance%20that's%20closer%20to%20the%20premium%20Ultra%20headphones.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Tyler%20Hayes)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Target%E2%80%99s%20offensive%20Halloween%20costume%20is%20a%20stumble%20at%20a%20key%20moment%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225144%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Target%20logo%20is%20displayed%20outside%20a%20Target%20store%20on%20August%2019%2C%202026%20in%20Los%20Angeles.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8defc079f11f0a89f909c2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223526%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20isn't%20the%20first%20time%20Target%20has%20found%20itself%20facing%20criticism%20over%20diversity%20issues.%3Cp%3EJustin%20Sullivan%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ETarget%20again%20finds%20itself%20in%20the%20cultural%20crosshairs%20%E2%80%94%20this%20time%20over%20an%20offensive%20Halloween%20costume.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20retailer%20quickly%20apologized%2C%20but%20the%20episode%20marks%20a%20stumble%20in%20a%20turnaround%20year.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20nature%20of%20Halloween%20merchandising%20can%20lead%20retailers%20to%20make%20embarrassing%20mistakes.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ETarget%20is%20again%20facing%20a%20storm%20of%20criticism%20over%20an%20unforced%20error%20on%20diversity%20as%20it%20tries%20to%20navigate%20a%20challenging%20turnaround.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Minnesota-based%20retailer%20landed%20in%20the%20cultural%20crosshairs%20after%20it%20marketed%20a%20children's%20Halloween%20costume%20with%20imagery%20that%20bore%20a%20striking%20resemblance%20to%20racist%20minstrel%20show%20posters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20retailer%20pulled%20the%20merchandise%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftarget-apology-offensive-halloween-costume-circus-clown-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eissued%20an%20apology%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0on%20Monday%2C%20but%20critics%20on%20social%20media%20have%20not%20been%20so%20quick%20to%20let%20the%20issue%20go.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20astonishing%20that%20they%20found%20themselves%20in%20the%20situation%20yet%20again%2C%26quot%3B%20former%20Target%20vice%20chairman%20Gerald%20Storch%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20Target's%20stock%20closed%20nearly%204%25%20below%20its%20price%20on%20Monday%2C%20before%20the%20story%20broke%20overnight.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20company%20spokesperson%20declined%20to%20comment%20beyond%20the%20statement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20a%20very%20unfortunate%20misstep%20that%20interrupts%20a%20stream%20of%20good%20news%20from%20Target%2C%20because%20the%20business%20has%20been%20making%20progress%2C%26quot%3B%20Global%20Data%20retail%20analyst%20Neil%20Saunders%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETarget%20last%20week%20reported%20its%20second%20quarter%20of%20strong%20sales%20and%20traffic%20growth%20as%20it%20looks%20to%20mount%20a%20comeback%20after%20years%20of%20lackluster%20performance.%20The%20company%20is%20now%20in%20the%20midst%20of%20a%20critical%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftarget-aiming-win-shoppers-during-back-school-season-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eback-to-school%20shopping%3C%2Fa%3E%20season.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhat%20they'll%20need%20to%20watch%20is%20whether%20this%20opens%20old%20wounds%20about%20DEI%2C%20whether%20it%20alienates%20some%20customer%20groups%2C%26quot%3B%20Saunders%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETarget%20endured%20a%20year%20of%20boycotts%20in%202025%20after%20the%20company%20wound%20down%20several%20of%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftarget-ends-dei-initiatives-memo-2025-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ediversity%2C%20equity%2C%20and%20inclusion%3C%2Fa%3E%20initiatives.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETarget's%20latest%20stumble%20%E2%80%94%20and%20those%20from%20other%20brands%20in%20recent%20years%20%E2%80%94%20shows%20how%20the%20fast-paced%2C%20boundary-pushing%20nature%20of%20Halloween%20merchandising%20can%20be%20especially%20risky%20for%20retailers.%20Costume%20makers%20can%20easily%20veer%20into%20negative%20stereotypes%20and%20offensive%20tropes%20in%20the%20attempt%20to%20create%20something%20funny%20or%20scary.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStorch%20said%20the%20company%20should%20not%20get%20too%20distracted%20with%20this%20episode%20and%20continue%20its%20focus%20on%20its%20core%20business%3A%20offering%20products%20that%20people%20need%20and%20want.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20Halloween%20costume%20snafu%20just%20leaves%20you%20puzzled%20how%20anyone%20could%20have%20seen%20that%20and%20thought%20it%20was%20OK%2C%20but%20it%20isn't%20a%20policy%20issue.%20It's%20an%20execution%20issue%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3EWhat%20do%20you%20think%20of%20Target's%20latest%20misstep%3F%20Let%20us%20know%20in%20the%20comments%20below.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftarget-costume-offensive-stumble-key-moment-turnaround-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787691257000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df05245e6f385a5168c3f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F