.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Nitin%20Gadkari%E2%80%99s%20office%20said%2C%20%E2%80%9CIn%20that%20context%2C%20Gadkari%20said%20that%20he%20could%20no%20longer%20take%20on%20as%20much%20work%20as%20before%20and%20that%20the%20younger%20generation%20should%20be%20given%20an%20opportunity%20to%20take%20greater%20responsibility.%20His%20remarks%20were%20clearly%20related%20to%20the%20functioning%20and%20future%20leadership%20of%20the%20Trust.%20However%2C%20some%20television%20channels%20are%20presenting%20the%20statement%20as%20a%20political%20remark%2C%20taking%20it%20out%20of%20its%20actual%20context.%E2%80%9D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TNN%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A98%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Of%2027%20lakh%20%E2%80%98logical%20discrepancy%E2%80%99%20deletions%20in%20West%20Bengal%2C%20only%207%20lakh%20appealed%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787689642000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-133524211%2Cimgsize-216828.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Findia%2Fof-27-lakh-logical-discrepancy-deletions-in-west-bengal-only-7-lakh-appealed%2Farticleshow%2F133524158.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22A%20bench%20of%20CJI%20Surya%20Kant%20and%20Justices%20Joymalya%20Bagchi%20and%20V%20Mohana%20was%20informed%20by%20senior%20advocate%20Gopal%20Sankaranarayanan%20that%20of%20total%2038.1%20lakh%20appeals%20filed%20before%20the%20SIR%20appellate%20tribunals%2C%20an%20overwhelming%2031%20lakh%20were%20filed%20by%20those%20who%20challenged%20inclusion%20of%20names%20in%20the%20rolls%20claiming%20they%20were%20ineligible%20to%20be%20voters%20in%20Bengal.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22DHANANJAY%20MAHAPATRA%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A98%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%20British%20Army%20commander%20testing%20war%20robots%20says%20they%20aren't%20always%20the%20right%20tool%20for%20the%20job%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226048%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20Ukrainian%20soldier%20wearing%20camouflage%20looks%20towards%20an%20uncrewed%20ground%20vehicle%20driving%20on%20a%20dirt%20road%20between%20two%20green%2C%20grassy%20fields.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df76045e6f385a5168caa%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EUkraine's%20use%20of%20ground%20drones%20is%20of%20the%20latest%20examples%20of%20evolutions%20in%20drone%20warfare.%3Cp%3EGenya%20SAVILOV%20%2F%20AFP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EA%20British%20Army%20commander%20says%20ground%20robots%20can%20be%20useful%20but%20come%20with%20drawbacks.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EUGVs%20can%20create%20logistics%2C%20power%2C%20navigation%2C%20and%20control%20challenges%20for%20troops.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EUkraine%20shows%20their%20value%20may%20be%20mainly%20in%20dangerous%2C%20specialized%20missions%20that%20protect%20soldiers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20commander%20of%20a%20British%20Army%20battalion%20tasked%20with%20experimenting%20with%20new%20technologies%20said%20that%20his%20unit%20has%20tested%20out%20dozens%20of%20ground%20robots.%20He%20concluded%20that%20they%20can%20be%20useful%2C%20but%20only%20for%20certain%20missions.%20And%20they%20come%20with%20a%20long%20list%20of%20challenges.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20Western%20militaries%20rush%20to%20absorb%20lessons%20from%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukrainian-robots-change-how-army-endures-war-beyond-saving-lives-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewar%20in%20Ukraine%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20integrate%20more%20uncrewed%20systems%20into%20their%20respective%20forces%2C%20soldiers%20are%20finding%20that%20some%20systems%20might%20look%20good%20on%20paper%20but%20aren't%20effective%20in%20all%20combat%20scenarios.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-teaching-nato-troops-how-ground-robots-work-war-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGround%20robots%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20in%20particular%2C%20can%20face%20weight%2C%20navigation%2C%20cost%2C%20and%20power%20constraints%20that%20raise%20questions%20about%20when%20and%20how%20they%20should%20be%20used.%20In%20Ukraine's%20case%2C%20the%20systems%20have%20seen%20use%20in%20logistics%20operations%2C%20replacing%20soldiers%20in%20highly%20dangerous%20areas%20of%20the%20battlefield%2C%20but%20soldiers%20have%20also%20said%20they're%20not%20a%20catch-all%20solution.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20a%20recent%20US%20Army-led%20exercise%20at%20Fort%20Irwin%20in%20California%2C%20a%20handful%20of%20American%20allies%20and%20partners%20gathered%20with%20US%20forces%20to%20experiment%20with%20new%20systems%20in%20a%20simulated%20conflict%20against%20a%20near-peer%20adversary.%20The%20British%20Army's%20experimentation%20unit%2C%20the%202nd%20Battalion%2C%20The%20Yorkshire%20Regiment%2C%20was%20present%20for%20the%20event%20alongside%20the%20unit%20that%20will%20take%20over%20their%20experimentation%20role%2C%20the%201st%20Battalion%20Irish%20Guards.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20the%20recent%20exercise%2C%20Lt.%20Col.%20John%20Black%2C%20commander%20of%20the%202nd%20Battalion%20of%20the%20Yorkshire%20Regiment%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20he%20and%20his%20unit%20have%20seen%20and%20tested%20a%20wide%20range%20of%20uncrewed%20ground%20vehicles%2C%20or%20UGVs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAny%20use%20case%20you%20can%20think%20of%2C%20we've%20tried%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20adding%20that%20they're%20not%20just%20driving%20it%20around%20to%20see%20how%20it%20works%3B%20rather%2C%20they%20are%20focused%20on%20%26quot%3Btrying%20to%20employ%20it%20in%20a%20tactical%20scenario.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThrough%20that%20experimentation%2C%20Black%20and%20his%20troops%20have%20encountered%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eproblems%20that%20can%20make%20UGVs%20difficult%20to%20use.%20For%20instance%2C%20many%20of%20the%20medium-%20to%20large-sized%20UGVs%20they%20tested%20required%20trailers%20or%20flatbed%20trucks%20to%20transport.%20Depending%20on%20how%20soldiers%20are%20moving%20and%20what%20they're%20carrying%2C%20that%20creates%20a%20logistical%20burden.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20once%20they've%20moved%20it%20into%20position%2C%20troops%20still%20have%20to%20figure%20out%20how%20to%20get%20it%20into%20the%20fight.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEven%20if%20they've%20got%20quite%20long%20range%20and%20good%20speed%2C%20there's%20still%20going%20to%20be%20a%20process%20where%20you're%20moving%20them%20into%20the%20fight%2C%26quot%3B%20Black%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225832%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20Ukrainian%20man%20operates%20a%20ground%20robot%20that's%20carrying%20a%20small%20quadcopter%20aerial%20drone%20in%20a%20warehouse.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df7b245e6f385a5168cad%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223888%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGround%20drones%20could%20be%20useful%20in%20certain%20scenarios%2C%20but%20some%20challenges%20could%20make%20them%20ineffective.%3Cp%3EGenya%20SAVILOV%20%2F%20AFP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EUGVs%20can%20also%20create%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Epower%20and%20refueling%20challenges.%20Depending%20on%20the%20system%2C%20specifically%20it's%20size%2C%20range%2C%20and%20capabilities%2C%20troops%20in%20the%20field%20may%20need%20to%20carry%20extra%20batteries%2C%20generators%2C%20or%20fuel%20%E2%80%94%20or%20periodically%20bring%20the%20robot%20back%20to%20a%20charging%20point.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERemote%20control%20introduces%20another%20set%20of%20problems%2C%20from%20maintaining%20a%20reliable%20connection%20to%20keeping%20the%20robot%20on%20course.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20systems%20can%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-soldiers-ground-robots-for-resupply-missions-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estruggle%20with%20difficult%20terrain%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOften%2C%20their%20advertised%20range%20doesn't%20translate%20cleanly%20to%20real-world%20conditions%2C%20such%20as%20uneven%20ground.%20Obstacles%20%26quot%3Bconfound%26quot%3B%20most%20UGVs%2C%20Black%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhether%20UGVs%20can%20rely%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukrainian-forces-using-assault-ground-robots-for-logistics-because-shortages-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eautonomous%20features%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20a%20particularly%20thorny%20subject.%20Autonomy%20has%20become%20a%20major%20area%20of%20interest%20across%20uncrewed%20capabilities%2C%20but%20Black%20said%20some%20manufacturers%20have%20moved%20away%20from%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eoffering%20autonomous%20UGVs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20seen%2C%20over%20the%20last%20few%20years%2C%20these%20vendors%20stop%20offering%20autonomous%20ones%20because%20it's%20unworkable%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20explaining%20that%20such%20autonomous%20features%20can%20result%20in%20the%20system%20being%20more%20expensive%20and%20difficult%20to%20use.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20those%20limitations%2C%20Black%20said%20there%20are%20certain%20situations%20where%20he%20sees%20value%2C%20including%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-commander-used-drones-c4-packed-robots-clear-breach-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebreaches%20and%20mine%20removal%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20missions%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eare%20incredibly%20dangerous%20for%20soldiers.%20For%20that%20reason%2C%20militaries%20have%20been%20using%20remote-controlled%20technologies%20for%20breaching%20fortified%20positions%20and%20removing%20mines%20for%20decades.%20Certain%20UGVs%20coming%20online%20now%20could%20be%20the%20next%20evolution%20in%20that%20technology%2C%20but%20other%20methods%20could%20prove%20more%20practical.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGround%20robots%20are%20seeing%20growing%20use%20in%20Ukraine%2C%20sometimes%20operating%20as%20a%20safer%20option%20than%20sending%20soldiers%20into%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-war-robots-are-surging-into-the-kill-zone-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3Bthe%20kill%20zone%26quot%3B%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20deliver%20supplies%20and%20ammo.%20Ukraine%20has%20also%20used%20them%20offensively%2C%20such%20as%20driving%20one%20equipped%20with%20a%20gun%20off%20a%20drone%20boat%20in%20a%20first-of-its-kind%20robotic%20amphibious%20assault.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20their%20growing%20use%20in%20that%20fight%20hasn't%20settled%20the%20debate%20on%20their%20overall%20usefulness.%20Black%20indicated%20that%20they%20might%20be%20a%20niche%20tool%2C%20most%20effective%20only%20in%20those%20cases%20where%20keeping%20a%20soldier%20out%20of%20harm's%20way%20matters%20most.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbritish-army-commander-says-ground-robots-arent-always-right-tool-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787689500000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8df82279f11f0a89f90a41%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbritish-army-commander-says-ground-robots-arent-always-right-tool-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Uncrewed%20ground%20vehicles%2C%20or%20UGVs%2C%20can%20present%20logistics%2C%20power%2C%20navigation%2C%20and%20control%20challenges%20for%20soldiers%2C%20he%20said.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22cpanella%40businessinsider.com%20(Chris%20Panella)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Gujarat's%20Khijadiya%20Sanctuary%20Confirmed%20As%20Key%20Black-Necked%20Stork%20Site%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22A%20comprehensive%20study%20by%20the%20Gujarat%20Ecological%20Education%20and%20Research%20(GEER)%20