p%3EThe%20late%20Dolly%20Parton%20has%20left%20behind%20quite%20a%20legacy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Queen%20of%20Country%20broke%20musical%20records%2C%20released%20hit%20songs%2C%20acted%20in%20movies%20and%20on%20TV%20shows%2C%20and%20helmed%20a%20range%20of%20projects%20%E2%80%94%20from%20theme%20parks%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-tennessean-travel-stop-what-its-like-photos-review-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etravel%20stops%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20libraries%20and%20dinner%20shows.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20you%20may%20be%20familiar%20with%20her%20iconic%20looks%20and%20be%20able%20to%20sing%20the%20words%20to%20her%20hit%20%26quot%3B9%20to%205%2C%26quot%3B%20there%20are%20a%20few%20things%20you%20may%20not%20know%20about%20the%20musical%20legend%20and%20her%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAlthough%20Parton%20had%20her%20own%20theme%20park%2C%20she%20never%20went%20on%20any%20of%20the%20rides.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223558%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F600088aba8de7700187d3e8f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222669%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ERon%20Davis%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EDollywood%2C%20which%20opened%20in%201961%2C%20is%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvisited-dolly-parton-theme-park-dollywood-surprising-things-first-time-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etheme%20park%20in%20Pigeon%20Forge%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Tennessee%2C%20fashioned%20after%20Parton's%20childhood%20fantasies.%20It%20boasts%20an%20array%20of%20roller%20coasters%20and%20water%20rides%2C%20but%20Parton%20has%20never%20experienced%20them%20herself.%C2%A0%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20don't%20ride%20the%20rides%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20told%20The%20New%20York%20Times%20in%202019.%20%26quot%3BI%20never%20have.%20I%20have%20a%20tendency%20to%20get%20motion%20sickness.%20Also%2C%20I'm%20a%20little%20bit%20chicken.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWith%20all%20my%20hair%2C%20I%20got%20so%20much%20to%20lose%2C%20like%20my%20wig%20or%20my%20shoes.%20I%20don't%20like%20to%20get%20messed%20up%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20added.%20%26quot%3BI'm%20gonna%20have%20some%20handsome%20man%20mess%20it%20up%2C%20I%20don't%20want%20some%20ride%20doing%20it.%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EShe%20didn't%20write%20her%20hit%20%26quot%3BI%20Will%20Always%20Love%20You%26quot%3B%20about%20a%20romantic%20partner.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223244%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60007e4ea81ea100188db3eb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222432%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMichael%20Ochs%20Archives%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20Will%20Always%20Love%20You%2C%26quot%3B%20later%20popularized%20by%20the%20late%20Whitney%20Houston%2C%20is%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamous-songs-written-by-different-celebrities-2019-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eiconic%20song%20in%20music%20history%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EContrary%20to%20popular%20belief%2C%20the%20lyrics%20center%20on%20the%20end%20of%20a%20professional%20relationship%2C%20rather%20than%20a%20romantic%20one.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThroughout%20the%20late%201960s%20and%20early%201970s%2C%20Parton%20performed%20with%20her%20mentor%20Porter%20Wagoner%20and%20appeared%20on%20his%20eponymous%20TV%20show.%20But%20when%20Parton%20was%20ready%20to%20leave%20the%20show%20and%20spearhead%20her%20own%20career%2C%20a%20rift%20began%20to%20form%20between%20the%20pair.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere%20was%20a%20lot%20of%20grief%20and%20heartache%20there%2C%20and%20he%20just%20wasn't%20listening%20to%20my%20reasoning%20for%20my%20going%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20told%20CMT%20in%20a%202011%20interview.%20%26quot%3BI%20thought%2C%20'Well%2C%20why%20don't%20you%20do%20what%20you%20do%20best%3F%20Why%20don't%20you%20just%20write%20this%20song%3F'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20wrote%20%26quot%3BI%20Will%20Always%20Love%20You%26quot%3B%20later%20that%20day%20and%20sang%20it%20to%20him%20the%20next.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHe%20started%20crying%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20told%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tennessean.com%2Fstory%2Fentertainment%2Fmusic%2F2015%2F12%2F26%2Fdolly-parton-remembers-writing-always-love-you%2F77762172%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ethe%20Tennessean%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%202015.%20%26quot%3BWhen%20I%20finished%2C%20he%20said%2C%20'Well%2C%20hell!%20If%20you%20feel%20that%20strong%20about%20it%2C%20just%20go%20on%20%E2%80%94%20providing%20I%20get%20to%20produce%20that%20record%20because%20that's%20the%20best%20song%20you%20ever%20wrote.'%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EParton%20created%20a%20library%20to%20promote%20literacy.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224698%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dolly%20parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60008bc6a8de7700187d3e9b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223523%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAndrew%20Harnik%2FAP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%201995%2C%20Parton%20was%20inspired%20by%20her%20father's%20illiteracy%20and%20opened%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcelebrities-who-started-charities-2018-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDolly's%20Imagination%20Library%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20Sevier%20County%2C%20Tennessee%2C%20to%20provide%20an%20avenue%20for%20kids%20to%20learn%20to%20read%20by%20giving%20them%20free%20books.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20daddy%20just%20loved%20it%20when%20all%20the%20little%20kids%20would%20call%20me%20'The%20Book%20Lady%2C'%26quot%3B%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdollyparton.com%2Fimagination-library%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ereads%20a%20quote%20from%20Parton%20%3C%2Fa%3Eon%20the%20library's%20website.%20%26quot%3BThat%20meant%20more%20to%20him%20than%20the%20fact%20that%20I%20had%20become%20a%20star%20and%20worked%20my%20butt%20off.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20organization%20has%20since%20sent%20over%20120%20million%20free%20books%20to%20children%20worldwide.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EHer%20hit%20%26quot%3BJolene%26quot%3B%20was%20partially%20inspired%20by%20a%20bank%20teller.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222723%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60007ed4a8de7700187d3e43%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222042%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EDebra%20L%20Rothenberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20country%20lament%20%26quot%3BJolene%2C%26quot%3B%20one%20of%20Parton's%20biggest%20hits%2C%20is%20a%20tale%20of%20flirtation%2C%20slightly%20inspired%20by%20a%20bank%20teller%20who%20set%20her%20sights%20on%20Parton's%20husband%2C%20Carl%20Dean%20%E2%80%94%20whom%20Parton%20said%20also%20loved%20the%20attention.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20was%20kinda%20like%20a%20running%20joke%20between%20us%20%E2%80%94%20when%20I%20was%20saying%2C%20'Hell%2C%20you're%20spending%20a%20lot%20of%20time%20at%20the%20bank.%20I%20don't%20believe%20we've%20got%20that%20kind%20of%20money%2C'%26quot%3B%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npr.org%2F2008%2F10%2F09%2F95520570%2Fdolly-partons-jolene-still-haunts-singers%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EParton%20told%20NPR%20in%202008%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%26quot%3BSo%20it's%20really%20an%20innocent%20song%20all%20around%2C%20but%20sounds%20like%20a%20dreadful%20one.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20that%20same%20interview%2C%20Parton%20said%20the%20song's%20name%20came%20to%20her%20when%20she%20met%20a%20fan%20with%20red%20hair%20and%20green%20eyes%2C%20which%20she%20incorporated%20into%20the%20song's%20lyrics.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20said%2C%20'Well%2C%20you're%20the%20prettiest%20little%20thing%20I%20ever%20saw.%20So%20what%20is%20your%20name%3F'%20And%20she%20said%2C%20'Jolene%2C'%26quot%3B%20Parton%20recalled.%20%26quot%3B%20%E2%80%A6%20I%20said%2C%20'That%20is%20pretty.%20That%20sounds%20like%20a%20song.%20I'm%20going%20to%20write%20a%20song%20about%20that.'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EShe's%20Miley%20Cyrus'%20honorary%20godmother.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222404%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dolly%20parton%20miley%20cyrus%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60007f51a8de7700187d3e45%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221797%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton%20and%20Miley%20Cyrus.%3Cp%3EKevin%20Mazur%2FGetty%20Images%20for%20The%20Recording%20Academy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBack%20in%20the%201990s%2C%20Billy%20Ray%20Cyrus%20hit%20it%20big%20with%20%26quot%3BAchy%20Breaky%20Heart%26quot%3B%20and%20opened%20for%20some%20of%20Parton's%20shows.%20He%20also%20appeared%20in%20her%20video%20for%20%26quot%3BRomeo.%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20has%20said%20the%20two%20connected%20because%20of%20their%20country%20roots%2C%20and%20so%20he%20asked%20his%20longtime%20friend%20to%20be%20his%20daughter%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-miley-cyrus-godmother-grammys-tribute-2019-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMiley%20Cyrus'%20godmother%3C%2Fa%3E.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20never%20did%20do%20a%20big%20ceremony%2C%20but%20I'm%20so%20proud%20of%20her%2C%20love%20her%2C%20and%20she's%20just%20like%20one%20of%20my%20own%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20told%20%26quot%3BGood%20Morning%20America%26quot%3B%20anchor%20Robin%20Roberts%20in%202009.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20also%20guest-starred%20on%20the%20Disney%20Channel%20sitcom%20%26quot%3BHannah%20Montana%2C%26quot%3B%20where%20she%20played%20Miley's%20character's%20godmother.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20singer%20once%20lost%20a%20Dolly%20Parton-lookalike%20contest.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221535%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dolly%20parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F5fff6edbfe7e140019f7ed31%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221152%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EGetty%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.elle.com%2Fculture%2Fa29282948%2Fdolly-parton-jolene-interview-2019%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EParton%20described%20herself%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20%26quot%3Bflashy%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bflamboyant%26quot%3B%20during%20a%202019%20interview%20with%20Elle%2C%20adding%2C%20%26quot%3BHad%20I%20not%20been%20a%20girl%2C%20I%20definitely%20would%20have%20been%20a%20drag%20queen.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20when%20she%20had%20the%20chance%20to%20embrace%20the%20glamour%20during%20a%20lookalike%20contest%20where%20she%20just%20needed%20to%20be%20herself%2C%20Parton%20lost.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAt%20a%20Halloween%20contest%20years%20ago%20on%20Santa%20Monica%20Boulevard%2C%20where%20all%20the%20guys%20were%20dressed%20up%20like%20me%2C%20and%20I%20just%20overexaggerated%20my%20look%20and%20went%20in%20and%20just%20walked%20up%20onstage%20%E2%80%A6%20I%20didn't%20win%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said%20in%20that%20same%202009%20interview%20with%20Roberts.%20%26quot%3BI%20didn't%20even%20come%20in%20close%2C%20I%20don't%20think.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EParton%20played%20a%20lot%20of%20musical%20instruments.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224576%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60008225a81ea100188db40b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223432%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EGems%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20country%20legend%20was%20a%20talented%20multi-instrumentalist%20who%20played%20the%20dulcimer%2C%20banjo%2C%20guitar%2C%20piano%2C%20recorder%2C%20and%20saxophone%2C%20among%20others.%C2%A0%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.vogue.com%2Farticle%2Fdolly-parton-interview-album-tour%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2016%20interview%20with%20Vogue%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Parton%20said%20she%20played%20%26quot%3Bsome%20of%20everything.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20family's%20very%20musical%2C%20and%20everybody%20played%20musical%20instruments%2C%20so%20we%20just%20grabbed%20up%20anything%20and%20tried%20to%20play%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20%26quot%3BLike%20I%20said%2C%20I%20ain't%20all%20that%20good%20at%20it%2C%20but%20I%20can%20play%20enough%20to%20make%20a%20show!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EHer%20tattoos%20cover%20up%20small%20scars.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222956%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F5ff374446056b60018721d07%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222216%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJim%20Cooper%2FAP%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EParton's%20tattoos%20are%20something%20of%20an%20urban%20legend%2C%20with%20fans%20speculating%20for%20years%20whether%20she%20has%20any%20at%20all.%20In%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fpeople.com%2Fcountry%2Fdolly-parton-addresses-tattoo-rumors-and-finally-reveals-moving-reason-behind-her-tasteful-ink%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2020%20interview%20with%20People%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20she%20cleared%20up%20some%20of%20the%20confusion.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20said%20she%20was%20sick%20for%20a%20while%2C%20and%20her%20feeding%20tube%20and%20other%20procedures%20left%20scars%20that%20she%20decided%20to%20cover%20up%20with%20ribbon%2C%20bow%2C%20and%20butterfly%20tattoos%2C%20among%20others.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20do%20have%20some%20tattoos%2C%20that's%20true%2C%20but%20they're%20tasteful.%20I'm%20not%20a%20tattoo%20girl%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20said.%20%26quot%3BMy%20tattoos%20are%20pretty%2C%20they're%20artful%2C%20and%20they%20usually%20started%20out%20to%20cover%20some%20scar%2C%20not%20to%20make%20a%20big%20statement.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EParton%20has%20said%20she%20sleeps%20in%20her%20makeup.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226772%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%20in%20Dallas%20Cowboys%20outfit%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8de97479f11f0a89f9095b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224516%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDolly%20Parton's%20famous%20for%20her%20full%20glam.%3Cp%3ERon%20Jenkins%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20beauty%20gurus%20will%20tell%20you%20that%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-that-are-bad-for-your-skin-2018-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecritical%20step%20in%20skincare%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20washing%20your%20makeup%20off%20before%20bed%2C%20but%20Parton's%20beauty%20routine%20flies%20in%20the%20face%20of%20conventional%20wisdom.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20never%20know%20if%20you're%20going%20to%20wreck%20the%20bus%2C%20you%20never%20know%20if%20you're%20going%20to%20be%20somewhere%20in%20a%20hotel%20and%20there's%20going%20to%20be%20a%20fire%2C%26quot%3B%20Parton%20told%20The%20New%20York%20Times%20in%20her%202019%20interview.%20%26quot%3BSo%20I%20leave%20my%20makeup%20on%20at%20night%20and%20clean%20my%20face%20in%20the%20morning.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20singer%20once%20rejected%20an%20offer%20for%20Elvis%20Presley%20to%20record%20her%20song.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dolly%20parton%20and%20elvis%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6001af80dd0659001a8b73b0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMichael%20Ochs%20Archives%2FGetty%3B%20AP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20Houston%20shattered%20records%20with%20her%20remake%20of%20Parton's%20%26quot%3BI%20Will%20Always%20Love%20You%26quot%3B%20for%20%26quot%3BThe%20Bodyguard%26quot%3B%20(1992)%20soundtrack%2C%20the%20King%20of%20Rock%20and%20Roll%20wanted%20to%20sing%20it.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20said%20Presley's%20manager%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felvis-tom-hanks-colonel-tom-parker-oscar-worthy-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EColonel%20Tom%20Parker%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20once%20contacted%20her%20to%20discuss%20his%20client%20possibly%20covering%20the%20song.%20The%20deal%20fell%20apart%20after%20Parton%20realized%20that%20she%20would%20have%20to%20relinquish%20at%20least%2050%25%20of%20the%20publishing%20royalties.%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20cried%20all%20night.%20I%20mean%2C%20it%20was%20like%20the%20worst%20thing.%20You%20know%2C%20it's%20like%2C%20'Oh%2C%20my%20God%20%E2%80%A6%20Elvis%20Presley%2C'%26quot%3B%20Parton%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.latimes.com%2Fentertainment-arts%2Fmusic%2Fstory%2F2023-09-15%2Fdolly-parton-elvis-i-will-always-love-you-not-allowed-to-cover%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erecalled%20in%20an%20interview%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%26quot%3BAnd%20other%20people%20were%20saying%2C%20'You're%20nuts.%20It's%20Elvis%20Presley.%20I%20mean%2C%20hell%2C%20I'd%20give%20him%20all%20of%20it.'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20said%2C%20'I%20can't%20do%20that.%20Something%20in%20my%20heart%20says%2C%20don't%20do%20that%2C'%26quot%3B%20she%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EShe%20preferred%20pie%20over%20cake%20for%20her%20birthday.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221005%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20Parton%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F60008099a8de7700187d3e54%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22754%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EChristopher%20Polk%2F%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20traditional%20to%20have%20cake%20on%20birthdays%2C%20but%20according%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%