ay%20movie%20%26quot%3BChristmas%20on%20the%20Square%26quot%3B%20as%20an%20angel%2C%20which%20seems%20fitting%20given%20she%20saved%20her%209-year-old%20costar%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdolly-parton-saved-child-star-from-being-hit-by-vehicle-2020-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETalia%20Hill%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20on%20set.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%202020%20interview%20with%20Inside%20Edition%2C%20Hill%20said%20she%20was%20nearly%20hit%20by%20an%20oncoming%20vehicle%20on%20set%2C%20but%20Parton%20pulled%20her%20out%20of%20the%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParton%20then%20reportedly%20told%20her%2C%20%26quot%3BWell%2C%20I%20am%20an%20angel%2C%20you%20know.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAnd%20I%20was%20in%20shock.%20She%20hugged%20me%20and%20shook%20me%20and%20said%2C%20'I%20saved%20your%20life!'%26quot%3B%20Hill%20said.%20%26quot%3BAnd%20my%20mom%20was%20crying%2C%20like%2C%20'Yes%2C%20you%20did%2C%20Dolly%20Parton.%20Yes%2C%20you%20did.'%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EDolly%2C%20the%20cloned%20sheep%2C%20was%20named%20after%20Parton.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222728%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dolly%20the%20sheep%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F5ff370d73793140019e283d2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222046%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMatthew%20Polak%2FSygma%2FSygma%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%201996%2C%20another%20Dolly%20made%20waves%20%E2%80%94%20but%20this%20one%20was%20a%20female%20sheep%20and%20the%20first%20mammal%20cloned%20from%20an%20adult%20cell.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESir%20Ian%20Wilmut%2C%20who%20led%20the%20team%20of%20scientists%20in%20Scotland%20behind%20the%20creation%20of%20Dolly%2C%20told%20the%20BBC%2C%20%26quot%3BDolly%20is%20derived%20from%20a%20mammary%20gland%20cell%2C%20and%20we%20couldn't%20think%20of%20a%20more%20impressive%20pair%20of%20glands%20than%20Dolly%20Parton's.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%2