ume%20Contest.%3Cp%3EReza%20Venegas%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESydney%20Grace%20Young%20represented%20the%20University%20of%20Tennessee%20Volunteers%20with%20her%20state%20costume.%20It%20featured%20an%20orange-and-silver%20bikini%20adorned%20with%20the%20school's%20logo%2C%20beaded%20fringe%2C%20and%20orange-and-white%20back%20and%20headpieces%2C%20both%20made%20of%20feathers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYoung%20and%20her%20family%20spent%20more%20than%2090%20hours%20hand-bedazzling%20the%20outfit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMiss%20Texas%20blossomed%20with%20blue%20florals%20onstage.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224066%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Miss%20Texas%20Alexis%20Maxine%20Fuetsch%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db32579f11f0a89f906b1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225082%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMiss%20Texas%20Alexis%20Maxine%20Fuetsch%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%3Cp%3EReza%20Venegas%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlexis%20Maxine%20Fuetsch%20celebrated%20her%20state's%20official%20flower%2C%20the%20bluebonnet%2C%20with%20her%20costume.%20She%20wore%20a%20floral%20backpiece%2C%20a%20crystal%20crown%20with%20more%20flowers%2C%20and%20a%20bejeweled%20bodysuit%20that%20matched%20her%20thigh-high%20boots.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20costume%20was%20meant%20to%20honor%20the%20women%20of%20Texas%20and%20their%20pride%20in%20their%20state.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMiss%20Vermont%20was%20the%20epitome%20of%20autumn%20with%20a%20tree-inspired%20look.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224266%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Miss%20Vermont%20Katherine%20McQuade%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db34379f11f0a89f906b2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMiss%20Vermont%20Katherine%20McQuade%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%3Cp%3EReza%20Venegas%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EKatherine%20McQuade%20wore%20a%20brown%2C%20beaded%20bikini%20decorated%20with%20pink%20florals%20and%20green%20leaves.%20The%20set%20matched%20her%20brown%20gloves%2C%20fringe%20heels%2C%20and%20branch-inspired%20backpiece%2C%20which%20made%20her%20resemble%20a%20tree.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESim%C3%B3n%20Villalba%20designed%20her%20outfit%20to%20mirror%20the%20landscapes%20of%20Vermont%20in%20the%20fall.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMiss%20West%20Virginia%20looked%20to%20the%20flowers%20of%20the%20Appalachian%20Mountains%20for%20her%20costume.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224186%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Miss%20West%20Virginia%20Alanna%20Lynch%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8dbbb879f11f0a89f90718%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225232%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMiss%20West%20Virginia%20Alanna%20Lynch%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%3Cp%3EReza%20Venegas%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlanna%20Lynch%20wanted%20to%20highlight%20the%20Appalachian%20Mountains%20with%20her%20costume%2C%20as%20West%20Virginia%20is%20the%20only%20state%20that%20resides%20completely%20within%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHer%20green%20bodysuit%20looked%20like%20grass%2C%20while%20her%20sheer%20cape%20embodied%20a%20mountain%20covered%20in%20florals%20and%20greenery.%20Those%20flowers%20exploded%20out%20of%20the%20top%20of%20the%20backpiece%2C%20which%20formed%20the%20shape%20of%20a%20mountain.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMiss%20Wyoming%20embraced%20the%20bison's%20fierce%20and%20majestic%20nature.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224306%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Miss%20Wyoming%20Melanie%20San%20Roman%20in%20the%202026%20Miss%20USA%20State%20Costume%20Contest.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider