d-nearly-11000-acres-along-the-mimbres-river-as-a-new-wildlife-area-safeguarding-historic-water-rights-rare-river-habitat-and-a-2-mile-stretch-of-the-desert-stream%2Famp_articleshow%2F133520433.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fnew-mexico-has-protected-nearly-11000-acres-along-the-mimbres-river-as-a-new-wildlife-area-safeguarding-historic-water-rights-rare-river-habitat-and-a-2-mile-stretch-of-the-desert-stream%2Famp_articleshow%2F133520433.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I've%20traveled%20over%204%2C500%20miles%20on%20Amtrak%20trains.%20My%20rides%20have%20been%20great%20and%20filled%20with%20surprises.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Malia%20stands%20in%20front%20of%20the%20Amtrak%20logo%20on%20a%20train.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8ddb7c79f11f0a89f9084d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAfter%20traveling%20over%204%2C500%20miles%20on%20Amtrak%2C%20I've%20learned%20some%20surprising%20things%20about%20train%20travel.%3Cp%3EMalia%20Yoshioka%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EIn%20three%20months%2C%20I've%20traveled%20over%204%2C500%20miles%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-train-ride-what-to-pack-frequent-traveler-2025-8%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20trains%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20come%20across%20some%20surprises.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFor%20example%2C%20my%20routes%20sometimes%20coincide%20with%20Amtrak's%20partnership%20with%20the%20National%20Park%20Service.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI've%20also%20learned%20that%20Amtrak%20trains%20don't%20have%20middle%20seats.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EFrom%20taking%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjapan-bullet-train-first-time-shinkansen-pros-cons-osaka-tokyo-2025-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebullet%20train%20in%20Japan%20%3C%2Fa%3Eto%20backpacking%20around%20Europe%2C%20I've%20visited%2043%20countries%20so%20far%2C%20and%20I%20try%20to%20travel%20by%20rail%20whenever%20possible.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20when%20I%20reviewed%20the%20states%20I've%20visited%20in%20the%20US%20over%20the%20years%2C%20I%20found%20that%20I%20almost%20always%20flew%20to%20get%20from%20point%20A%20to%20point%20B%2C%20bypassing%20most%20of%20the%20country%20in%20the%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20I%20recently%20decided%20to%20focus%20on%20flight-free%20travel%20in%20order%20to%20see%20as%20many%20states%20as%20I%20could%20from%20the%20ground.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAmtrak%20has%20been%20the%20perfect%20way%20for%20me%20to%20do%20that.%20In%20just%20three%20months%2C%20I've%20traveled%20more%20than%204%2C500%20miles%2C%20crossing%20through%20two%20countries%20and%2017%20US%20states%2C%20as%20well%20as%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-washington-dc-left-philadelphia-things-miss-about-home-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWashington%2C%20DC%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20a%20few%20things%20that%20have%20surprised%20me%20most%20about%20the%20rides.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d1a0c12f-de9c-4b88-8712-44bc33fbf48c%5C%22%3EThere%20are%20no%20middle%20seats%20on%20Amtrak%20trains%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225580%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20interior%20of%20an%20Amtrak%20train%20with%20two%20seats%20in%20each%20row.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68e5562e5dbc4fd10daa5b03%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224185%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20seats%20on%20Amtrak%20trains%20are%20organized%20in%20pairs.%3Cp%3EDragos%20Asaftei%2FShutterstock%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20the%20main%20draws%20of%20Amtrak%20is%20that%20passengers%20will%20never%20get%20stuck%20with%20a%20dreaded%20middle%20seat.%20Instead%2C%20all%20the%20seats%20in%20coach%20are%20organized%20in%20pairs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20is%20especially%20great%20when%20the%20route%20is%20less%20crowded%20and%20I'm%20able%20to%20have%20a%20whole%20row%20to%20myself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22720b3659-7c74-4e4b-9c49-0ebf5b4f3eff%5C%22%3EI%20actually%20enjoy%20sitting%20next%20to%20strangers%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20it's%20nice%20when%20I%20get%20a%20row%20to%20myself%2C%20I've%20really%20enjoyed%20sitting%20with%20strangers%20as%20well.%20In%20fact%2C%20I've%20never%20booked%20one%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-i-wish-brought-train-ride-packing-list-amtrak-portland-sacramento%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak's%20private%20cabins%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20partly%20because%20I%20enjoy%20the%20serendipity%20of%20getting%20to%20meet%20other%20passengers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20may%20seem%20as%20if%20being%20in%20close%20proximity%20to%20a%20complete%20stranger%20would%20be%20uncomfortable%2C%20but%20I've%20gotten%20lucky%20and%20have%20never%20had%20major%20issues.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETypically%2C%20my%20seatmate%20and%20I%20start%20the%20trip%20formally%2C%20but%20by%20the%20end%2C%20we're%20swapping%20food%20and%20stories.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2263533596-5b29-4cb9-a89b-30bed7b75b4f%5C%22%3ETrain%20travel%20gives%20me%20a%20glimpse%20into%20life%20in%20different%20parts%20of%20the%20country%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223677%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20view%20of%20a%20large%20body%20of%20water%20from%20a%20train%20car%20with%20floor-to-ceiling%20windows.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68e662f81c1f80efbec52705%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222757%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20love%20seeing%20the%20country%20through%20the%20windows%20of%20an%20Amtrak%20train.%3Cp%3EMalia%20Yoshioka%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20my%20favorite%20parts%20about%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flong-amtrak-trip-bedroom-with-service-dog-better-than-flying%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etrain%20travel%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20passing%20through%20so%20many%20unique%20areas%20of%20the%20country.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOut%20the%20window%20of%20the%20train%2C%20I've%20seen%20hazy%20sunsets%20and%20sunrises%2C%20steep%20mountain%20peaks%2C%20and%20lakeside%20towns.%20I've%20also%20caught%20glimpses%20of%20everyday%20life%20%E2%80%94%20families%20out%20walking%20their%20dogs%2C%20friends%20sitting%20at%20a%20beer%20garden%20near%20the%20tracks%2C%20and%20children%20holding%20their%20mothers'%20hands%20while%20waving%20frantically%20at%20the%20passing%20train.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20is%20a%20great%20way%20to%20see%20what%20life%20is%20like%20in%20other%20parts%20of%20the%20US%2C%20some%20of%20which%20I've%20added%20to%20my%20own%20travel%20bucket%20list.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20keep%20track%20of%20them%20all%2C%20I%20create%20a%20Google%20map%20before%20boarding%20that%20lists%20all%20the%20stations%20I'll%20be%20passing%20through.%20This%20allows%20me%20to%20visualize%20the%20route%20and%20add%20notes%20along%20the%20way.%20If%20I%20see%20a%20cute%20railroad%20town%20or%20a%20pretty%20view%20I'd%20like%20to%20explore%2C%20I%20add%20a%20new%20pin%20to%20my%20map.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ce29136c-fc72-4aea-b8d6-7f475aa0e350%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20has%20a%20joint%20partnership%20with%20the%20National%20Park%20Service%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20hand%20holding%20a%20pamphlet%20for%20the%20Amtrak%20Trails%20and%20Rails%20program%20over%20one%20about%20New%20River%20Gorge%20National%20Park.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68e54d911c1f80efbec5173b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22768%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Trails%20and%20Rails%20program%20is%20a%20joint%20partnership%20between%20Amtrak%20and%20the%20National%20Park%20Service.%3Cp%3EMalia%20Yoshioka%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESometimes%2C%20my%20train%20route%20coincides%20with%20the%20Trails%20and%20Rails%20program%2C%20