2https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-cross-country-road-trip-stops-united-states%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecross-country%20road%20trip%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20my%20dog%20and%20the%20weather%20had%20placed%20me%20behind%20schedule.%20This%20stop%2C%20located%20in%20Cornersville%2C%20Tennessee%2C%20would%20be%20a%20welcome%20break.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20already%20planning%20to%20visit%20Dollywood%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvisited-dolly-parton-theme-park-dollywood-surprising-things-first-time-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDolly%20Parton's%20theme%20park%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20Smoky%20Mountains%2C%20but%20when%20I%20learned%20the%20Queen%20of%20Country%20had%20opened%20this%20attraction%20of%20sorts%20in%20late%20June%2C%20I%20planned%20a%20detour%20to%20check%20it%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20a%20veteran%20road%20tripper%2C%20I%20was%20curious%20to%20see%20how%20it%20compared%20to%20other%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbuc-ees-has-a-cult-following-photos-review-2018-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebeloved%20roadside%20chains%3C%2Fa%3E%20like%20Buc-ee's%2C%20Wawa%2C%20and%20Love's.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20stop%20seemed%20pretty%20promising%20from%20the%20outside.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%20entrance%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a78a99fa493d60f7bd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E005%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20travel%20stop%20is%20about%20an%20hour%20south%20of%20Nashville%20and%20open%2024%2F7%20%E2%80%94%20it%20seemed%20quite%20busy%20when%20I%20arrived%20around%205%3A30%20p.m.%20on%20a%20Saturday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20truck%20stop%20looked%20quite%20large%20at%20around%2025%2C000%20square%20feet%20on%2018%20acres%2C%20though%20the%20parking%20lot%20felt%20smaller%20than%20I%20expected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20seeing%20the%20Buc-ee's%20in%20Luling%2C%20Texas%20%E2%80%94%20the%20largest%20convenience%20store%20in%20the%20world%2C%20spanning%20almost%2080%2C000%20square%20feet%20%E2%80%94%20I%20was%20imagining%20a%20space%20that%20could%20fit%20a%20couple%20of%20football%20fields.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20lot%2C%20however%2C%20wasn't%20much%20bigger%20than%20your%20average%20QuikTrip's.%20Still%2C%20l%20easily%20located%20an%20empty%20spot.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20could%20already%20hear%20live%20country%20music%20wafting%20from%20the%20establishment%2C%20which%20got%20me%20hyped.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIt's%20not%20just%20pet-friendly%20%E2%80%94%20there's%20also%20a%20dog%20park.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Doggy%20Parton%20dog%20park%20entrance%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a71d1a1d028ba1256d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20even%20entering%20the%20building%2C%20there%20was%20a%20lot%20to%20see.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20first%20priority%20was%20taking%20my%20road-trip%20partner%2C%20my%20Chow%20Chow%2C%20Flora%2C%20to%20Doggy%20Parton.%20This%20modest-sized%2C%20fenced-in%20dog%20park%20was%20on%20par%20with%20the%20ones%20at%20most%20Love's%20truck%20stops%2C%20but%20it%20had%20much%20more%20personality.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20fence%20was%20adorned%20with%20silhouettes%20of%20Parton%20juggling%20a%20tangle%20of%20leashes%2C%20getting%20pulled%20by%20what%20appeared%20to%20be%20Great%20Danes%20and%20German%20shepherds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIt%20was%20a%20hit%20with%20my%20pup.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dog%20at%20dog%20park%20at%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%20with%20fence%20showing%20silhoutte%20image%20of%20Dolly%20walking%20dogs%20behind%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a71d1a1d028ba1256c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223854%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20grassy%20park%20looked%20very%20clean%20and%20had%20multiple%20waste-bag%20dispensers%2C%20trash%20cans%2C%20and%20even%20a%20picnic%20table.%20Flora%20loved%20that%20she%20could%20be%20off-leash%20after%20so%20many%20hours%20in%20the%20car.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20truck%20stop%20looked%20vibrant%20and%20photo-worthy.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Colorful%20music-note%20art%20on%20ground%20and%20colorful%20wall%20mural%20at%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a84569a4ec219f986f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E004%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20the%20dog%20park%2C%20I%20had%20to%20indulge%20in%20a%20couple%20of%20outdoor%20photo%20opportunities.%20One%20of%20Parton's%20old%20tour%20buses%20was%20parked%20beside%20a%20colorful%20mural%20depicting%20Tennessee's%20pastoral%2C%20rolling%20hills.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20side%20of%20the%20blue%20bus%20had%20a%20giant%20retro%20photograph%20of%20Parton%20behind%20the%20wheel%2C%20her%20name%20written%20in%20rhinestones%2C%20and%20a%20winking%20%26quot%3BDLY%20925%26quot%3B%20license%20plate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20rainbow%20music%20staff%20created%20a%20walkway%20from%20the%20bus%20to%20the%20front%20entrance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20side%20of%20the%20building%20was%20the%20mural%2C%20%26quot%3BButterfly%20Lullaby%20(Mountain%20Gospel)%2C%26quot%3B%20designed%20by%20the%20artist%20Britt%20Flood.%20The%20giant%20butterfly%20in%20its%20center%20attracted%20many%20other%20travelers%2C%20who%20were%20queued%20up%20to%20snap%20photos%20as%20they%20grew%20wings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENearby%2C%20I%20spotted%20an%20outdoor%20patio%20with%20lawn%20games%20and%20more%20Instagram%20potential%20between%20the%20cute%20retro%20pickup%20truck%20with%20flowers%20spilling%20out%20of%20the%20flatbed%20and%20another%20large%20mural.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20stop%20has%20practical%20offerings%20for%20road%20trippers.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Large%20coffee%20dispensers%2C%20sugar%2C%20on%20counter%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a71d1a1d028ba1256a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E026%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFinally%2C%20I%20stepped%20foot%20inside%20the%20travel%20stop.%20I%20entered%20through%20the%20far%20left%20entrance%2C%20which%20is%20closer%20to%20the%20trucker's%20fuel%20pumps.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20brought%20me%20into%20perhaps%20the%20most%20practical%20part%20of%20the%20establishment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERight%20away%2C%20the%20beverage%20dispensers%20and%20shelves%20of%20food%20reminded%20me%20of%20a%20typical%20convenience%20store%20but%20more%20elevated%20with%20shiny%2C%20dark%20tiles%20and%20walls%20decorated%20with%20vinyls%20and%20images%20of%20Parton.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EInside%2C%20there%20are%20plenty%20of%20grab-and-go%20snacks%20and%20essentials.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Gas-station%20snacks%20on%20shelves%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a71d1a1d028ba1256b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E025%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELike%20any%20gas%20station%2C%20there%20was%20a%20fridge%20of%20cold%20drinks%2C%20large%20carafes%20of%20coffee%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-trader-joes-snacks-family-long-trip-car-ride-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eroad-trip%20snacks%3C%2Fa%3E%20(like%20beef%20jerky%20and%20gummy%20worms)%2C%20and%20plenty%20of%20automotive%20accessories%20to%20help%20a%20long-hauler.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThere%20are%20showers%20and%20laundry%20available%2C%20too.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Orange%20colored%20couches%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a78a99fa493d60f7bb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E009%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20glad%20to%20see%20that%20the%20stop%20wasn't%20just%20playing%20with%20trucking%20as%20a%20gimmicky%20aesthetic%20to%20entertain%20tourists%2C%20but%20was%20actually%20providing%20valuable%20services%20to%20professionals%20passing%20through%20town.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20was%20a%20lounge%20for%20truckers%20decorated%20with%20tour%20posters%2C%20showers%20available%20to%20use%20for%20%2416%20(or%20free%20with%20a%20fuel%20purchase)%2C%20and%20a%20laundry%20room%20charging%20%244%20a%20wash.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EBeyond%20that%2C%20there%20is%20a%20ton%20of%20merchandise.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Shirts%20and%20merchandise%20on%20shelf%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a74569a4ec219f9867%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E011%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EPast%20this%20section%20of%20gas-station%20staples%2C%20the%20building%20opened%20up%20to%20a%20full%20Parton%20paradise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20enormous%20chandelier%20made%20up%20of%20sparkling%20guitars%20hung%20over%20rows%20of%20bedazzled%20merchandise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20held%20back%20on%20buying%20t