%20during%20a%20long%20drive.%20So%2C%20my%20bar%20was%20pretty%20high%20for%20Dolly's.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EEven%20the%20bathrooms%20here%20felt%20photo-worthy.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Woman%20taking%20selfie%20in%20mirror%20in%20bathroom%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a74569a4ec219f986a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E014%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EGiven%20the%20stop's%20popularity%2C%20I%20thought%20there%20could%20have%20been%20more%20stalls%2C%20but%20the%20facilities%20looked%20sparkling%20clean.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20bathroom%20also%20just%20looked%20beautiful.%20It%20was%20covered%20with%20large%20black-and-white%20portraits%20of%20Dolly%20getting%20ready%20in%20her%20dressing%20room%2C%20the%20perfect%20backdrop%20for%20a%20bathroom%20selfie.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIn%20terms%20of%20food%20and%20beverage%20options%2C%20there%20was%20a%20whole%20Dolly%20Parton%20universe.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Cup%20of%20Ambition%20coffee%20at%20Dolly%20Parton%20travel%20stop%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8c76a74569a4ec219f986b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E012%3Cp%3ERen%C3%A9e%20Reizman%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20had%20three%20options%20for%20dining%3A%20the%20grab-and-go%20DLY%20BBQ%2C%20an%20unnamed%20full-service%20restaurant%20that%20offered%20a%20Southern-style%20buffet%20for%20%2421.99%20per%20adult%20and%20barbecue%20plates%2C%20and%20Cup%20of%20Ambition%20for%20coffee%2C%20drinks%2C%20pastries%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fice-cream-soft-serve-frozen-yogurt-custard-differences-which-best-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esoft-serve%20ice%20cream%3C%2Fa%3