ved-someone-he-had-a-personal-relationship-with%2Farticleshow%2F133520188.cms%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia-indiatimes-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fgeorgia-sheriffs-office-arrested-a-second-deputy-in-one-month-over-alleged-flock-misuse-latest-case-involved-someone-he-had-a-personal-relationship-with%2Famp_articleshow%2F133520188.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fgeorgia-sheriffs-office-arrested-a-second-deputy-in-one-month-over-alleged-flock-misuse-latest-case-involved-someone-he-had-a-personal-relationship-with%2Famp_articleshow%2F133520188.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20retired%20husband%20wanted%20me%20to%20join%20his%20adventures.%20Saying%20no%20was%20the%20best%20thing%20for%20our%20marriage.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20poses%20with%20her%20husband%20and%20a%20dog%20on%20a%20beach.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db42f79f11f0a89f906ba%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20she%20had%20to%20learn%20to%20set%20boundaries%20when%20her%20husband%20retired%20and%20she%20continued%20to%20work.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Allison%20Snyder.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EEarly%20in%20our%20relationship%2C%20I%20often%20put%20my%20new%20career%20aside%20to%20help%20my%20husband's%20business.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWhen%20he%20retired%2C%20I%20thought%20it%20would%20be%20easier%20to%20finally%20put%20my%20career%20first.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIt%20took%20shifting%20my%20perspective%20to%20set%20boundaries%2C%20which%20was%20the%20best%20thing%20for%20both%20of%20us.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fage-gap-marriage-anxiety-wife-unprepared-older-husband-2024-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emet%20my%20husband%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20he%20owned%20an%20established%20backcountry%20ski%20and%20hospitality%20business.%20He%20loved%20the%20outdoors%20and%20exploration%3B%20they%20were%20woven%20into%20his%20day-to-day%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%2C%20on%20the%20other%20hand%2C%20was%20just%20beginning%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjob-market-reinvention-career-pivot-upskilling-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ereinvent%20my%20career%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20shifting%20from%20lawyering%20to%20freelance%20writing%20and%20consulting.%20During%20our%20first%20five%20years%20together%2C%20I%20often%20set%20aside%20my%20own%20ambitions%20to%20help%20his%20business.%20In%20doing%20so%2C%20I%20always%20reasoned%20that%20his%20business%20was%20profitable%20while%20my%20career%20was%20still%20in%20the%20startup%20stage%20and%20not%20yet%20earning%20much%20money.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShifting%20our%20collective%20energy%20toward%20my%20career%20was%20one%20of%20many%20factors%20we%20considered%20when%20he%20decided%20to%20retire%20four%20years%20ago.%20At%20the%20time%2C%20he%20was%2056%2C%20and%20I%20was%2041.%20In%20explaining%20his%20decision%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffire-financial-independece-early-retirement-investing-lifestyle-boredom-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esell%20the%20business%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BIt's%20your%20turn%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20thought%20it%20would%20be%20that%20easy%2C%20that%20we%20would%20quickly%20slide%20into%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsoft-retirement-three-day-workweek-benefits-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enext%20phase%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20him%20having%20more%20time%20for%20fun%2C%20me%20having%20more%20time%20for%20work.%20It%20wasn't%20that%20simple.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2212a599b6-25b9-4245-89dd-5f625d9f7184%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20husband%20wanted%20me%20to%20join%20his%20adventures%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20year%20into%20his%20retirement%2C%20we%20stood%20on%20a%20stretch%20of%20white%20sand%20in%20the%20distant%20reaches%20of%20the%20Caribbean.%20We%20were%20a%20few%20weeks%20into%20a%20two-month%20stay%20in%20one%20of%20the%20most%20beautiful%20places%20I'd%20ever%20been%20and%2C%20we%20were%20hours%20into%20one%20of%20the%20worst%20arguments%20we'd%20ever%20had.%20Rehashing%20the%20same%20misunderstanding%20we'd%20had%20for%20months%2C%20the%20conversation%20had%20deteriorated%20to%20absolutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20just%20wish%20my%20wife%20wanted%20to%20spend%20time%20with%20me!%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20while%20I%20retorted%20with%20something%20about%20how%20I%20wished%20my%20husband%20wanted%20me%20to%20have%20a%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20particular%20clash%20had%20begun%20when%20I%20decided%20to%20work%20instead%20go%20kitesurfing%2C%20but%20we'd%20had%20similar%20disagreements%20over%20skiing%2C%20hiking%2C%20and%20sailing%20on%20other%20trips%20we'd%20taken%20and%20in%20our%20lives%20at%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20poses%20with%20a%20sail%20on%20a%20beach.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db4fe79f11f0a89f906bd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221603%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAn%20argement%20over%20choosing%20not%20to%20go%20kitesurfining%20brought%20some%20important%20issues%20to%20a%20head%20for%20the%20couple%2C%20the%20author%20said.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Allison%20Snyder.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20I%20could%20work%20from%20anywhere%2C%20I've%20been%20able%20to%20join%20my%20husband%20wherever%20he%20wanted%20to%20be%20in%20the%20newfound%20freedom%20of%20retirement%2C%20which%20is%20how%20we%20ended%20up%20on%20that%20white%20sand%20beach%2C%20not%20understanding%20each%20other's%20motives.%20My%20husband%20saw%20those%20two%20months%20as%20vacation%2C%20I%20saw%20them%20as%20regular%20life%2C%20and%20this%20led%20him%20to%20resent%20me%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fim-a-single-mom-who-takes-workcations-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworking%20too%20much%20on%20vacation%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20while%20I%20resented%20him%20because%20I%20wasn't%20working%20enough.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229b01af6c-d3a5-4be2-93ba-40e15d4c1adc%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ELearning%20to%20say%20no%20was%20hard%20but%20necessary%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20marital%20tension%20was%20something%20I'd%20been%20totally%20unprepared%20for.%20I'd%20thought%20once%20money%20was%20out%20of%20the%20equation%20%E2%80%94%20unlike%20helping%20with%20his%20business%2C%20going%20kite%20surfing%20didn't%20earn%20any%20money%20%E2%80%94%20it%20would%20be%20easy%20for%20both%20of%20us%20to%20prioritize%20my%20pursuits.%20But%20that%20didn't%20happen%20on%20its%20own.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223088%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20and%20her%20husband%20pose%20in%20a%20wooded%20area.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db49c3f7df8787cff3143%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20she%20enjoys%20going%20on%20adventures%20with%20her%20husband%2C%20but%20now%20knows%20she%20needs%20to%20prioritize%20her%20personal%20goals%20more.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Allison%20Snyder.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EEventually%2C%20our%20ongoing%20challenges%20made%20me%20realize%20that%20my%20drive%20to%20start%20a%20new%20career%20hinged%20on%20self-discipline.%20I%20had%20been%20waiting%20for%20something%20outside%20myself%2C%20namely%20my%20husband%2C%20to%20give%20me%20permission%20to%20prioritize%20my%20career%20in%20a%20way%20that%20made%20sense%20to%20me.%20Of%20course%2C%20he%20wanted%20me%20to%20be%20fulfilled%20as%20much%20as%20I%20did%2C%20but%20only%20I%20could%20know%20what%20that%20looked%20like%20for%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20this%20realization%2C%20something%20else%20came%20into%20focus.%20Looking%20back%2C%20I%20saw%20that%20my%20husband%20had%20never%20asked%20me%20to%20help%20with%20the%20business%20as%20much%20as%20I%20did%2C%20and%20now%2C%20in%20his%20retirement%2C%20I%20was%20falling%20into%20the%20same%20patterns%20again.%20Once%20I%20recognized%20my%20role%2C%20it%20became%20easier%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcancer-taught-me-stop-people-pleasing-how-set-boundaries-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eset%20boundaries%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20say%20no.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20first%2C%20I%20skewed%20a%20little%20too%20far%20toward%20my%20career%2C%20skipping%20out%20on%20sailing%20in%20the%20Sea%20of%20Cortez%2C%20kitesurfing%20in%20Turks%20and%20Caicos%2C%20and%20monthlong%20visits%20to%20the%20Italian%20Alps.%20This%20left%20us%20spending%20months%20apart%2C%20which%20was%20something%20neither%20of%20us%20wanted.%20%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3EBut%20that%20boundary-setting%2C%20even%20if%20a%20bit%20overzealous%2C%20nudged%20us%20to%20find%20a%20better%20balance%20and%20recognize%20that%20constant%20travel%20wasn't%20something%20we%20wanted%20to%20do%2C%20especially%20apart.%20After%20much%20trial%20and%20error%2C%20we%20decided%20to%20move%20part-time%20to%20Northern%20Italy%2C%20where%20he%20can%20explore%2C%20and%20I%20can%20sometimes%20join%2C%20while%20also%20finding%20my%20own%20rhythm.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhusband-early-retirement-taught-me-to-set-boundaries-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787677921000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8db42f79f11f0a89f906ba%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhusband-early-retirement-taught-me-to-set-boundaries-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20spent%20years%20prioritizing%20my%20husband's%20career.%20Now%20that%20he's%20retired%2C%20I'm%20finally%20making%20room%20for%20mine.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Allison%20Snyder)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Gold%20is%20back%20in%20the%20spotlight%20after%20the%20Treasury's%20surprise%20bond%20maneuvers%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Stacked%20gold%20bars%20marked%20999.9%20rest%20on%20a%20dark%20textured%20surface%20in%20close-up.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8d8e05450247c8d6c4714f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223002%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3Ecredit%20should%20read%20CFOTO%2FFuture%20Publishing%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EGold%20prices%20have%20spiked%20following%20the%20Treasury's%20interventions%20in%20the%20bond%20market.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20moves%20sparked%20fresh%20weakness%20in%20the%20dollar%2C%20which%20enhances%20gold's%20appeal%20to%20investors.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMeanwhile%2C%20issues%20like%20the%20US%20fiscal%20outlook%20and%20the%20Iran%20war%20are%20boosting%20gold's%20reputation%20as%20a%20hedge.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EGold%20prices%20have%20popped%20in%20recent%20days%20as%20a%20multitude%20of%20factors%20enhance%20the%20appeal%20of%20the%20precious%20metal%20among%20investors.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20range%20of%20macroeconomic%20and%20geopolitical%20issues%20have%20drummed%20up%20renewed%20discussions%20of%20the%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdebasement-trade-explained-currencies-government-bonds-crypto-bearish-economic-outlook-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edebasement%20trade%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20which%20says%20investors%20should%20flock%20to%20real%20assets%20as%20currencies%20like%20the%20dollar%20falter%20in%20the%20face%20of%20fiscal%20instability.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20latest%20talking%20point%20in%20that%20conversation%20came%20last%20week%2C%20when%20Scott%20Bessent%20announced%20that%20the%20US%20Treasury%20Department%20could%20double%20US%20bond%20purchases%20to%20%244%20billion.%20The%20move%20sent%20a%20signal%20to%20markets%20that%20the%20government%20was%20looking%20to%20artificially%20push%20yields%20down%20to%20control%20borrowing%20costs%2C%20something%20that%20investors%20interpret%20as%20inflationary.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGold%20prices%20spiked%20on%20the%20news%2C%20with%20the%20metal%20hitting%20three-month%20highs%20on%20Monday%2C%20and%20up%207%25%20in%20five%20days%20to%20top%20%244%2C700%20an%20ounce.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20broke%20out%20to%20the%20upside%20last%20Wednesday%20after%20US%20Treasury%20Secretary%20Scott%20Bessent%20announced%20a%20doubling%20of%20government%20bond%20repurchases%20at%20the%20long%20end%20of%20the%20curve%2C%26quot%3B%20stated%20David%20Morrison%2C%20senior%20market%20analyst%20at%20Trade%20Nation.%20%26quot%3BThis%20led%20to%20a%20sharp%20drop%20in%2010%20and%2030-year%20Treasury%20yields%20and%20a%20corresponding%20slump%20in%20the%20US%20dollar.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBessent's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-yields-jackson-hole-kevin-warsh-interest-rates-jeremy-siegel-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eplan%20to%20intervene%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20US%20bond%20market%20by%20buying%20long-dated%20Treasurys%20has%20sparked%20some%20criticism%2C%20including%20from%20his%20old%20investing%20mentor%2C%20hedge%20fund%20billionaire%20Stanley%20Druckenmiller%2C%20who%20wrote%20in%20an%20op-ed%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wsj.com%2Fopinion%2Flet-the-bond-market-speak-81529d74%3Fst%3Dgz2L17%26reflink%3Ddesktopwebshare_permalink%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EThe%20Wall%20Street%20Journal%3C%2Fa%3E%20this%20week%20that%20policymakers%20should%20%26quot%3Blet%20the%20bond%20market%20speak.%26quot%3B%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20so%20far%2C%20the%20moves%20have%20been%20bullish%20for%20gold%20prices%2C%20mainly%20due%20to%20the%20impact%20they've%20had%20on%20the%20US%20dollar.%20The%20greenback%20has%20dipped%20versus%20rival%20currencies%20since%20Bessent's%20announcement%2C%20setting%20up%20the%20conditions%20that%20help%20gold%20and%20other%20debasement%20trades%20like%20silver%20and%20bitcoin%20gain.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20helped%20to%20boost%20both%20gold%20and%20silver%20as%20these%20two%20precious%20metals%20have%20shown%20a%20close%20inverse%20correlation%20to%20the%20dollar%20since%20they%20pulled%20back%20from%20their%20respective%20all-time%20highs%20at%20the%20end%20of%20January%2C%26quot%3B%20Morrison%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMichael%20Hsueh%2C%20an%20FX%20%26amp%3B%20Commodities%20strategist%20at%20Deutsche%20Bank%2C%20wrote%20on%20Tuesday%20that%20Bessent's%20bond%20market%20maneuvers%20are%20likely%20sparking%20concern%20among%20investors%20regarding%20the%20US%20government's%20ability%20to%20finance%20its%20debt%20burden%20over%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20team's%20view%2C%20though%2C%20gold%20is%20in%20an%20excellent%20position%2C%20as%20it%20is%20likely%20to%20benefit%20regardless%20of%20how%20the%20bond%20market%20responds%20to%20the%20intervention.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20yields%20rise%20again%20despite%20the%20intervention%2C%20gold%20would%20appear%20likely%20to%20continue%20its%20rally%20as%20yields%20may%20be%20rising%20for%20'bad'%20reasons.%20On%20the%20other%20hand%2C%20the%20market%20could%20partly%20find%20a%20release%20valve%20through%20a%20weaker%20USD%2C%20if%20international%20investors%20become%20less%20willing%20to%20absorb%20supply%20at%20prevailing%20(lower)%20yields.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHsueh%20isn't%20the%20only%20finance%20pro%20who%20sees%20a%20rare%20win%2Fwin%20scenario%20ahead%20for%20gold%20as%20macro%20conditions%20reignite%20the%20debasement%20trade.%20With%20inflation%20still%20elevated%2C%20many%20investors%20are%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstock-market-outlook-nvidia-q2-earnings-jackson-hole-fed-rates-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewatching%20keenly%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20an%20update%20from%20Fed%20chair%20Kevin%20Warsh%20at%20Friday's%20Jackson%20Hole%20Economic%20Policy%20Symposium.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EChris%20Mancini%2C%20a%20portfolio%20manager%20at%20Gabelli%20Funds%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20he%20sees%20two%20possible%20ways%20Bessent's%20bond%20market%20intervention%20could%20be%20bullish%20for%20gold%20prices.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20evidence%20of%20market%20uneasiness%20with%20rising%20national%20debt%20as%20long-term%20yields%20spike%20and%20bond%20prices%20crater%20as%20investors%20demand%20higher%20returns%20for%20higher%20risk%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BGold%20is%20an%20asset%20which%20is%20no%20one's%20liability.%20%5BAdditionally%5D%2C%20its%20evidence%20of%20government%20market-manipulation%20which%20could%20presage%20more%20quantitative%20easing%20through%20money%20printing%20(quantitative%20easing)%20or%20other%20creative%20ways%20to%20affect%20the%20value%20of%20the%20dollar.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFinally%2C%20lingering%20fears%20around%20the%20Iran%20war%20are%20also%20thrusting%20gold%20back%20into%20the%20spotlight.%20Inflation%20concerns%20likely%20won't%20fully%20abate%20until%20the%20Strait%20of%20Hormuz%20is%20reopened%20and%20energy%20is%20flowing%20through%20to%20global%20markets%20again.%20That%20dynamic%20of%20geopolitical%20instability%20fueling%20inflation%20fears%20sets%20the%20stage%20for%20gold%20to%20keep%20gaining.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgold-prices-scott-bessent-treasury-yields-debasement-trade-economy-hedge-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787677402000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a8dab1c45e6f385a51688b4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%2