%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcollege-student-online-classes-traveling-world-2024-12%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eonline%20learning%20while%20traveling%3C%2Fa%3E%20the%20world.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETravel%20helped%20him%20become%20independent%20and%20resourceful.%20When%20we're%20home%2C%20he%20runs%20his%20own%20businesses.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%26quot%3BWorldschooling%26quot%3B%20isn't%20ideal%20for%20every%20family%20or%20even%20my%20other%20kids%2C%20but%20it's%20been%20great%20for%20my%20son.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20hour%20ago%2C%20Colt%20was%20leaning%20over%20the%20side%20of%20a%20Zodiac%20boat%20in%20Icy%20Bay%2C%20Alaska%2C%20lowering%20a%20Niskin%20bottle%20into%20glacier-fed%20water.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20things%20we're%20gonna%20be%20looking%20for%20are%20salinity%2C%20clarity%2C%20temperature%2C%20depth%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20told%20me%20as%20he%20collected%20a%20sample.%20%26quot%3BWe're%20also%20going%20to%20be%20looking%20at%20levels%20of%20chlorophyll%20and%20plankton.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20heading%20back%20to%20our%20main%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffirst-expeditition-cruise-things-to-know-surprises-national-geographic-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eexpedition%20ship%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20he%20also%20helped%20run%20a%20Secchi%20disk%20test%2C%20tow%20a%20pair%20of%20plankton%20nets%2C%20and%20haul%20chunks%20of%20floating%20ice%20aboard%20for%20the%20ship's%20science%20team%20to%20examine%20%E2%80%94%20all%20part%20of%20collecting%20data%20for%20a%20citizen-science%20project%20for%20NOAA.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EColt%20is%20my%2014-year-old%20son.%20For%20our%20family%2C%20this%20is%20the%20latest%20destination%20in%20six%20years%20of%20global%20travel.%20For%20him%2C%20it's%20also%20school.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22de72bad4-765b-46a8-b2f5-4911a71a53e3%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EIn%202020%2C%20our%20family%20began%20combining%20school%20and%20travel%20%E2%80%94%20and%20Colt%20has%20kept%20this%20arrangement%20going%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Family%20smiling%20at%20chichen-itza%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a85ce9485cca0a87cd8a9e6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221350%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20family%20spent%20years%20traveling%20around%20the%20world%20to%20places%20like%20Chich%C3%A9n%20Itz%C3%A1%20in%20Mexico.%3Cp%3EPhil%20Lockwood%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20early%202020%2C%20all%20three%20of%20my%20children%20were%20attending%20school%20remotely%2C%20same%20as%20just%20about%20every%20American%20kid.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20somewhere%20in%20that%20first%20year%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Flearning%2Fmasterclass-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eonline%20learning%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20my%20wife%20and%20I%20had%20a%20realization%3A%20If%20school%20was%20going%20to%20be%20experienced%20on%20a%20laptop%20anyway%2C%20the%20laptops%20might%20as%20well%20travel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20we%20started%20choosing%20destinations%20that%20could%20be%20incorporated%20into%20the%20curriculum.%20We%20explored%20the%20ruins%20of%20Chich%C3%A9n%20Itz%C3%A1%20instead%20of%20reading%20a%20chapter%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-places-to-visit-with-kids-and-adults-only-2023-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EMayan%20history%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Jungle%20and%20wildlife%20treks%20replaced%20biology%20worksheets.%20Instead%20of%20opening%20textbooks%2C%20we%20booked%20museum%20and%20architecture%20tours%20around%20the%20world.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20stopgap%20became%20a%20lifestyle%3A%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgave-up-traveling-full-time-with-family-successful-youtube-career-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esix%20years%20of%20constant%20travel%3C%2Fa%3E%20through%20more%20than%2030%20countries%20across%20all%20seven%20continents.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20classrooms%20reopened%20in%20the%20fall%20of%202021%2C%20our%20kids%20got%20to%20decide%20if%20they%20wanted%20to%20keep%20traveling%20or%20head%20home.%20Our%20oldest%20daughter%20went%20back%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fintroverts-hacks-rto-era-office-design-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ein-person%20learning%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Our%20middle%20daughter%20followed%20in%202025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EColt%20looked%20at%20the%20same%20options%20%E2%80%94%20a%20good%20school%20four%20blocks%20from%20our%20Denver%20home%2C%20the%20same%20one%20his%20sisters%20chose%2C%20or%20his%20passport%20%E2%80%94%20and%20picked%20the%20latter.%20He's%20chosen%20it%20every%20semester%20since.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20education%20became%20a%20mix%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-is-worldschooling-why-do-parents-choose-it-2022-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3Bworldschooling%26quot%3B%20on%20the%20road%3C%2Fa%3E%20through%20travel%20and%20formal%20schooling%20online.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20online%20half%20hasn't%20always%20been%20a%20slam%20dunk.%20We%20went%20through%20two%20state-sanctioned%20schools%20before%20landing%20on%20a%20private%20academy%20with%20a%20fully%20accredited%20K-12%20program%20that%20felt%20like%20a%20good%20fit.%20That%20accreditation%20matters%20to%20us%20since%20it%20helps%20keep%20every%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finside-high-schools-changing-value-of-college-trade-higher-education-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edoor%20to%20higher%20education%3C%2Fa%3E%20open.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20has%20nearly%20the%20same%20curriculum%20as%20in-person%20school%20%E2%80%94%20math%2C%20literature%2C%20even%20science%20experiments%20%E2%80%94%20minus%20the%20standardized%20state%20exams.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20real%20difference%20is%20%3Cem%3Ewhen%3C%2Fem%3E%20the%20work%20happens%2C%20not%20%3Cem%3Ewhether%3C%2Fem%3E%20it%20does.%20Assignment%20deadlines%20are%20flexible%2C%20and%20as%20long%20as%20everything%20is%20completed%20within%20the%20semester%2C%20credit%20is%20credit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20Colt%20works%20ahead%20whenever%20he%20knows%20we're%20about%20to%20lose%20connectivity%20%E2%80%94%20which%20is%20exactly%20how%20these%2010%20a.m.%20Zodiacs%20don't%20cost%20him%20a%20grade.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20only%20thing%20the%20virtual%20academy%20can't%20offer%20is%20P.E.%2C%20and%20between%20his%20trick-scooter%20crew%2C%20hikes%2C%20and%20swim%20days%2C%20Colt%20covers%20that%20with%20about%20six%20hours%20of%20activity%20a%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223146bf95-9d36-409d-ab2f-e37154a61358%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWorld%20travel%20has%20taught%20him%20things%20that%20a%20classroom%20could%20not%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kid%20in%20life%20jacket%20in%20Alaska%2C%20smiling%20with%20ship%20in%20distance%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a85cedf0b0f848e0c307270%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221350%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThroughout%20our%20travels%2C%20Colt%20has%20learned%20how%20to%20be%20a%20leader%20and%20improviser.%3Cp%3EPhil%20Lockwood%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBy%2011%2C%20Colt%20was%20our%20family's%20designated%20airport%20navigator.%20We'd%20land%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsingapore-airport-changi-my-favorite-layover-spot-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESingapore's%20Changi%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20Tokyo's%20Narita%20with%20a%20tight%20connection%2C%20and%20he'd%20ask%20to%20lead%20us%20gate-to-gate%20%E2%80%94%20usually%20across%20multiple%20concourses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20same%20year%2C%20he%20started%20his%20own%20YouTube%20channel%2C%20concepting%20his%20own%20episodes%20and%20arranging%20his%20own%20collaborations.%20He%20earned%20almost%205%2C000%20subscribers%20in%20his%20first%20three%20months.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20his%20oldest%20sister%20visited%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdos-and-donts-traveling-in-philippines-american-expat-2023-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20Philippines%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20the%20first%20time%2C%20it%20was%20Colt%20who%20gave%20her%20and%20her%20boyfriend%20a%20full%20city%20tour%20of%20his%20favorite%20haunts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20Hong%20Kong%20last%20winter%2C%20he%20wanted%20a%20silver%20chain%20necklace.%20He%20researched%20the%20best%20outdoor%20markets%2C%20mapped%20his%20route%2C%20and%20negotiated%20with%20vendors%20until%20he%20got%20his%20price.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe's%20also%20the%20child%20who%20will%20try%20any%20street%20food%20put%20in%20front%20of%20him%3A%20day-old%20chicks%20in%20Manila%2C%20horse%20sashimi%20in%20Kyoto%2C%20fried%20scorpions%20in%20Bangkok.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20the%20part%20that%20surprises%20people%20most%3A%20The%20travel%20didn't%20make%20him%20flighty.%20It%20made%20him%20an%20operator.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESix%20years%20of%20navigating%20unfamiliar%20places%20has%20convinced%20him%20he%20can%20just%20%E2%80%A6%20figure%20things%20out.%20So%20he%20does%20%E2%80%94%20at%20home%20as%20much%20as%20abroad.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20we%20travel%20regularly%2C%20we're%20not%20perpetually%20overseas.%20Since%20settling%20back%20in%20Denver%20in%202025%2C%20our%20two-week%20trips%20have%20dropped%20to%20about%20once%20every%20other%20month%2C%20with%20regular%20life%20in%20between.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20regular%20life%20is%20where%20his%20operator%20side%20really%20shows.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EColt%20runs%20a%20small%20reptile-breeding%20operation%20out%20of%20his%20bedroom%20%E2%80%94%20five%20terrariums%20of%20geckos%20with%20automated%20heating%2C%20misting%2C%20and%20incubation%20systems%20that%20keep%20everything%20alive%20while%20we're%20on%20the%20road.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kid%20smiling%20with%20geckos%20with%20tanks%20behind%20him%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a85ce940b0f848e0c307269%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221350%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20son%20runs%20a%20whole%20business%20from%20his%20room.%3Cp%3EPhil%20Lockwood%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20the%20geckos%20are%20just%20inventory%3B%20the%20business%20is%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20finds%20neighborhood%20kids%20who%20want%20one%2C%20builds%20a%20care%20plan%2C%20shops%20with%20their%20parents%20for%20gear%2C%20sets%20up%20the%20habitat%2C%20trains%20the%20family%2C%20then%20checks%20in%20for%20months%20afterward.%20He%20also%20pet-sits%20geckos%20for%20his%20clients%20(his%20word%2C%20not%20mine).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20his%20breeding%20pair%20outproduced%20his%20client%20list%2C%20he%20cold-called%20local%20reptile%20shops%20until%20they%20agreed%20to%20buy%20his%20hatchlings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20when%20he's%20not%20moving%20geckos%2C%20he's%20selling%20crafts%20and%20knocking%20on%20doors%2C%20offering%20to%20do%20odd%20jobs%20for%20neighbors%20to%20fund%20new%20scooter%20parts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20fall%2C%20he%20added%20Little%20Guy%20Lawncare%20to%20the%20portfolio%2C%20a%20neighborhood%20leaf-removal%20service%20complete%20with%20printed%20business%20cards.%20He%20launched%20it%20with%20a%20%24150%20loan%20from%20us%20that%20he%20paid%20off%20in%20his%20first%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENobody%20assigned%20any%20of%20this.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220dc4b85e-9ce6-4805-b8e7-7f197f4abe7c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI'm%20unsure%20what%20my%20son's%20future%20holds%2C%20but%20I'm%20confident%20he'll%20get%20where%20he%20wants%20to%20be%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Kid%20blowing%20leaves%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a85cec97e0482203ed1796f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221350%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIn%20Denver%2C%20my%20son%20runs%20several%20businesses%20on%20his%20own.%3Cp%3EPhil%20Lockwood%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWorldschooling%20comes%20in%20many%20forms.%20It%20isn't%20a%20fit%20for%20every%20family%2C%20and%20it%20can%20come%20with%20real%20costs%3B%20I%20won't%20pretend%20otherwise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20Colt's%20case%2C%20the%20main%20drawback%20is%20that%20we%20don't%20run%20into%20many%20children%20his%20age%20on%20our%20trips%20because%20we%20often%20travel%20while%20most%20of%20them%20are%20in%20school.%20That's%20no%20issue%20mid-hike%20or%20mid-dive%2C%20but%20on%20days%20at%20sea%20and%20long%20travel%20days%2C%20Colt%20gets%20bored%20and%20misses%20his%20geckos%20and%20his%20Denver%20friends.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20every%20semester%2C%20the%20school%20four%20blocks%20away%20is%20right%20there.%20Every%20semester%2C%20he%20weighs%20his%20options%20and%20chooses%20this%20life%20instead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20he%20skipped%20a%20grade%2C%20Colt%20is%20on%20track%20to%20graduate%20from%20high%20school%20at%2016%20and%20is%20hungry%20for%20more%20education%2C%20just%20not%20four%20years%20at%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerica-colleges-identity-crisis-students-class-2029-ai-paradox-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etraditional%20American%20university%3C%2Fa%3E.%20He's%20already%20eyeing%20an%20internship%20at%20the%20late%20Steve%20Irwin's%20Australia%20Zoo%2C%20and%20his%20endgame%20is%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbusiness-of-reptile-youtube-videos-with-influencer-brian-barczyk-2020-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ereptile%20rescue%20and%20breeding%20center%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20his%20own.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAll%20three%20of%20our%20kids%20are%20intelligent%2C%20kind%2C%20and%20talented%20%E2%80%94%20his%20sisters%20are%20thriving%20on%20more%20traditional%20paths%2C%20and%20I%20have%20zero%20doubt%20about%20their%20futures.%20Colt%20is%20just%20wired%20differently.%20Six%20years%20of%20world%20schooling%20did%20that%2C%20and%20somewhere%20along%20the%20way%2C%20it%20rewired%20my%20definition%20of%20%26quot%3Bprepared%2C%26quot%3B%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20can't%20tell%20you%20which%20country%20my%20son%20will%20be%20standing%20in%20at%2022%2C%20but%20I%20know%20he'll%20have%20gotten%20himself%20there%20%E2%80%94%20gate-to-gate%2C%20on%20his%20own%20itinerary%20%E2%80%94%20and%20that%20he'll%20be%20completely%20fine.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkid-online-school-while-traveling-the-world-working-well-worldschooling-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787674741000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a85ce9485cca0a87cd8a9e7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkid-online-school-while-traveling-the-world-working-well-worldschooling-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22My%20teenage%20son%20has%20spent%20years%20%26quot%3Bworldschooling%26quot%3B%20by%20attending%20online%20school%20virtually%20while%20traveling%20the%20world.%20For%20us%2C%20pros%20have%20outweighed%20cons.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Phil%20Lockwood)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22China%20warns%20US%20of%20retaliation%20if%20Trump's%20'Economic%20D-Day'%20sanctions%20hit%20their%20Iran%20oil%20trade%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1787674435000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-133518296%2Cimgsize-83090.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fchina%2Fchina-warns-us-of-retaliation-if-trumps-economic-d-day-sanctions-hit-their-iran-oil-trade%2Farticleshow%2F133518296.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftime